	chapter_group.6E77249F054DE990.title: "Others"
	chapter_group.6F7A871585ECF951.title: "Create"
	quest.001276A12E96ECD9.quest_desc: ["Though humble in form, the Melonshelf carries a curious purpose. It reduces Eterna by -2.00 and Quanta by -10.00%, seemingly weakening the flow of magic. Yet its strength lies in subtraction: some enchantment recipes demand precise balances of Eterna, Arcana, and Quanta. Where other shelves overflow with energy or chaos, the Melonshelf pares them back, lowering values into the exact ranges required. It is not a shelf of power, but of calibration—an odd fruit‑bound tool that refines enchantments through restraint, ensuring the ritual aligns with hidden formulas."]
	quest.001276A12E96ECD9.quest_subtitle: "The subtractive melons of restraint."
	quest.00143D4FC12AEFD9.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Split to branch your spell into multiple paths or duplicate its effect."]
	quest.00143D4FC12AEFD9.quest_subtitle: "Duplicate your spell effects"
	quest.00143D4FC12AEFD9.title: "Glyph: Split"
	quest.008FE059EE5DED9D.quest_subtitle: "You will rankup automatically as you play, Playtime is tracked by the in game player statistics menu so if you ever want to check progress that will be the easiest way"
	quest.008FE059EE5DED9D.title: "Server Ranks"
	quest.00ABBF2CB07D573C.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Harm to deal straightforward magical damage to your targets."]
	quest.00ABBF2CB07D573C.quest_subtitle: "Direct damage spell"
	quest.00ABBF2CB07D573C.title: "Glyph: Harm"
	quest.00D329407250AC7B.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Leap to add a powerful jump or leap effect to your spell sequences."]
	quest.00D329407250AC7B.quest_subtitle: "Jump with style"
	quest.00D329407250AC7B.title: "Glyph: Leap"
	quest.00F56E154697F550.quest_desc: ["Lay your weapon, armor, or tool upon this sacred table. Feed it with sigils of rebirth, and offer a material of the tier you desire. As the forge stirs, arcane fire engulfs your item, reshaping it into a new form—reborn with affixes and augments unseen before. This is no mere workbench, but the Enchantment Table of Affixes and Augments. Should fate deny you the outcome you seek, the ritual may be attempted again. Yet beware: its power does not reach the mythic tier."]
	quest.00F56E154697F550.quest_subtitle: "Forge Your Affixs!"
	quest.019BCC9FD9E7AF73.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Base Bangle to later attune it to elemental powers."
	quest.019BCC9FD9E7AF73.title: "Elemental Bangle"
	quest.01A02515B566D64D.quest_desc: [
		"A spell is built from glyphs."
		""
		"Unlock or obtain a basic glyph, such as Touch, Projectile, or Self."
		"These are forms that decide how your spell is delivered:"
		"point-blank, ranged, or centered on you."
	]
	quest.01A02515B566D64D.title: "Learning Your First Glyph"
	quest.01CEE6F9BFC64527.quest_desc: [
		"Ice spells use Frozen Bones collected from stray skeletons."
		"Face the cold undead and claim a bone to freeze your enemies."
	]
	quest.01CEE6F9BFC64527.title: "Ice Focus – Frozen Bone"
	quest.032A2CD8D3FE77CD.quest_desc: [
		"Holy spells use Divine Pearls crafted from precious metals and gems."
		"Prepare a pearl to channel radiant, protective magic."
	]
	quest.032A2CD8D3FE77CD.title: "Holy Focus – Divine Pearl"
	quest.03514F9C5BB6962F.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Boots is bound exclusively to the enchantments of footwear. It accepts only magics that enhance movement, resilience, and protection—whether granting swiftness, feather‑light steps, or resistance against hazards. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their boots become more than simple armor: they become instruments of mobility, carrying the bearer safely across perilous terrain. It is a tome of journey, a record of enchantments meant to guard every step taken into the unknown."]
	quest.03514F9C5BB6962F.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the stride."
	quest.0370441B648D99A1.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock at least one new Form glyph, such as AoE, Orbit, or Underfoot."
		""
		"Experiment by swapping your new Form into your existing spells."
		"Changing only the form can make a spell feel completely different."
	]
	quest.0370441B648D99A1.title: "New Forms, New Possibilities"
	quest.0390685AC152E26A.quest_desc: [
		"Experiment with automated casting tools, such as Spell Turrets or other automation blocks."
		""
		"Set up a simple automation:"
		"for example, a turret that protects an area or an automated utility spell."
	]
	quest.0390685AC152E26A.title: "Runes & Automation"
	quest.04987E54ADC2C057.quest_desc: ["Acquire a Drygmy Charm to summon a Drygmy, a creature that automates mob farming for drops."]
	quest.04987E54ADC2C057.quest_subtitle: "Summon a Drygmy to hunt mobs and gather drops on your behalf."
	quest.04987E54ADC2C057.title: "Drygmy Defender"
	quest.04D9F6587EF8D9B7.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Potion Jar to store, transport, or automate potion usage via Ars Nouveau systems."]
	quest.04D9F6587EF8D9B7.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Potion Jar to store and reuse your magical potions."
	quest.04D9F6587EF8D9B7.title: "Bottled Brews"
	quest.05C2A6E54898C963.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Cold Snap to unleash a burst of freezing magic over an area."]
	quest.05C2A6E54898C963.quest_subtitle: "Freeze the battlefield"
	quest.05C2A6E54898C963.title: "Glyph: Cold Snap"
	quest.0641F45BEA6C67E5.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Conjure Water to create water source blocks or water effects using magic."]
	quest.0641F45BEA6C67E5.quest_subtitle: "Summon water with spells"
	quest.0641F45BEA6C67E5.title: "Glyph: Conjure Water"
	quest.0671915D3BDDD07D.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Dispel to remove existing magical effects, glyphs, or lingering spells."]
	quest.0671915D3BDDD07D.quest_subtitle: "End magical effects"
	quest.0671915D3BDDD07D.title: "Glyph: Dispel"
	quest.067B3B3508CA4369.quest_desc: ["Drawn from the lingering flame of the Ender Dragon, Dragon’s Breath is a volatile essence of the void. It is not a shelf itself, but a vital reagent—its vapor binds enchantments to the silence of eternity. To wield it is to hold a fragment of the dragon’s final exhalation, a reminder that even in death, the End’s power lingers."]
	quest.067B3B3508CA4369.quest_subtitle: "Breath of the end."
	quest.073FD3884B2B11F7.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Amplify to increase damage or effectiveness of compatible spell components."]
	quest.073FD3884B2B11F7.quest_subtitle: "Boost spell power"
	quest.073FD3884B2B11F7.title: "Glyph: Amplify"
	quest.075F797809567E1F.quest_desc: ["Forged from pufferfish, prismarine, and bottled waters, the Seashelf channels the quiet wisdom of the deep. It grants +3.00 Eterna (Max 45.00) and +3.00% Arcana, offering a gentle surge of magical energy and insight. Though modest in power, its strength lies in clarity—revealing enchantments with the calm precision of ocean currents. The Seashelf is a shelf of balance, born from pressure and patience, guiding rituals with the rhythm of the tide."]
	quest.075F797809567E1F.quest_subtitle: "Foundation of sea, clarity of chance."
	quest.07D6CC12D577643E.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Craft to let your spells perform crafting actions in the world for you."]
	quest.07D6CC12D577643E.quest_subtitle: "Automation through magic"
	quest.07D6CC12D577643E.title: "Glyph: Craft"
	quest.07DE3A966516EA8B.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Overgrowth to rapidly spread vegetation and nature in the surrounding area."]
	quest.07DE3A966516EA8B.quest_subtitle: "Call on nature’s power to rapidly grow plants with this potent ritual."
	quest.07DE3A966516EA8B.title: "Ritual of Overgrowth"
	quest.07E6DD5E55528ED9.quest_subtitle: "Default Server Rank"
	quest.07E6DD5E55528ED9.title: "Pioneer"
	quest.084C24376A61DD75.quest_desc: ["The Salvaging Table may appear humble, but it holds remarkable power. Place your affix-laden treasures upon its surface—whether gleaming gems, battered armor, or trusted tools—and watch as it breaks them down, returning materials worthy of their rarity. From scraps to brilliance, this workbench transforms what was into what can be."]
	quest.084C24376A61DD75.quest_subtitle: "Salvage material from your spare gems and gear!"
	quest.0853964B50AF03B9.quest_subtitle: "10 days"
	quest.0853964B50AF03B9.title: "Maestro"
	quest.08803844E52178AA.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Fertility to improve breeding and crop growth in the area of effect."]
	quest.08803844E52178AA.quest_subtitle: "Empower crops and breeding with an aura of abundant life."
	quest.08803844E52178AA.title: "Ritual of Fertility"
	quest.08828F50F0F046EC.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Perfect Gems!"
	quest.08828F50F0F046EC.title: "Perfect Gems!"
	quest.088E3A32E7CA5C62.title: "Shadow Radiance Leggings"
	quest.08B6FA532A136AF2.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Linger to make certain spell effects remain in an area over time."]
	quest.08B6FA532A136AF2.quest_subtitle: "Persisting effects"
	quest.08B6FA532A136AF2.title: "Glyph: Linger"
	quest.08E0348D55A1A89F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Grindstone and Item Drain to turn items into XP fluid."
	quest.08E0348D55A1A89F.title: "Extracting Knowledge"
	quest.0A21A4342ADCF119.quest_subtitle: "Blocked attacks may harm the attacker."
	quest.0A21A4342ADCF119.title: "Reflective Defences"
	quest.0A4D8EB52C9E36F1.quest_desc: [
		"Complete the loop with an Electric Motor."
		"Use stored FE to spin Create shafts directly."
	]
	quest.0A4D8EB52C9E36F1.quest_subtitle: "Electric Motor"
	quest.0A4D8EB52C9E36F1.title: "FE Back to Kinetics"
	quest.0AA0E42062F73834.quest_desc: [
		"Using your spellbook, create a simple spell:"
		"- Form: Touch or Projectile"
		"- Effect: Break, Harm, or Light"
		""
		"Give your spell a name and icon."
		"This is your training spell: tweak it until you like how it feels."
	]
	quest.0AA0E42062F73834.title: "Building a Simple Spell"
	quest.0AC0711496C3C187.quest_desc: ["The Anvil is the cornerstone of reforging, where enchantments are combined, repaired, and strengthened. In Apotheosis, its limits have been lifted—the dreaded “Too Expensive” cap no longer exists. This means that even the most powerful enchantments can be merged without restriction, allowing adventurers to push their gear to absolute perfection. The Anvil is no longer a tool of compromise, but a forge of boundless potential, where patience and resources alone determine the heights of your craft."]
	quest.0AC0711496C3C187.quest_subtitle: "A forge without limits."
	quest.0B3035CC7DF8A8F5.quest_subtitle: "Hoes may be used to bonemeal crops."
	quest.0B3035CC7DF8A8F5.title: "Nature's Blessing"
	quest.0B5B9268FDBFFA92.quest_subtitle: "Ores may be found when mining stone."
	quest.0B5B9268FDBFFA92.title: "Boon of the Earth"
	quest.0B894A074DA5352D.quest_desc: [
		"Learn to transfer Source between jars and machines."
		""
		"Use Source Relays or similar blocks to automatically move Source around your base."
		"Your goal is to have Source automatically feeding your Imbuement Chamber and Enchanting Apparatus."
	]
	quest.0B894A074DA5352D.title: "Moving the Magic"
	quest.0BA1F97922DCEA4B.quest_subtitle: "Anchor more Disintegration sites for remote ore processing."
	quest.0BA1F97922DCEA4B.title: "Ritual of Disintegration (Array)"
	quest.0C226BA3A527C601.quest_subtitle: "Packagers will send items when they have a redstone pulse, a stock ticker will give a redstone pulse when it requests items but you can also attach a lever or timer to have packages send without being requested"
	quest.0C226BA3A527C601.title: "Automating Sending Packages"
	quest.0C3DFC1F6FCDE255.quest_desc: [
		"Lightning-aligned spells use Bottles of Lightning as their focus item."
		"Capture a Lightning Bottle to unlock the power of the storm."
	]
	quest.0C3DFC1F6FCDE255.title: "Lightning Focus - Bottle o' Lightning"
	quest.0C8704036CDCADDD.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Lesser Earth Focus to tap into the stability of stone."
	quest.0C8704036CDCADDD.title: "Lesser Earth Focus"
	quest.0CA2F692B4446E9D.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Rotating Spell Turret to sweep an area with magical fire."
	quest.0CA2F692B4446E9D.title: "Rotating Spell Turret"
	quest.0CEB783C38B9C892.quest_subtitle: "15 days"
	quest.0CEB783C38B9C892.title: "Mastermind"
	quest.0D1C23A7E4A8B315.quest_desc: ["Each gem is more than stone—it is a vessel of power. Within its facets lies an affix, a fragment of magic or might waiting to be bound. When placed upon the Smithing Table, a gem may be set into the socket of a weapon, armor, or tool, weaving its affix into the item’s essence. Through socketing, gear becomes more than forged metal; it becomes a tapestry of enchantments, each gem a thread that strengthens, sharpens, or reshapes destiny."]
	quest.0D1C23A7E4A8B315.quest_subtitle: "Represents all gems, not just one."
	quest.0D330FAD6C993DBC.quest_desc: ["Advance to an Apprentice Spell Book to unlock more powerful spells and glyph options."]
	quest.0D330FAD6C993DBC.quest_subtitle: "Empower your magic with an Apprentice Spell Book and stronger spells."
	quest.0D330FAD6C993DBC.title: "Apprentice Arcanist"
	quest.0D57924560D3A7D5.quest_desc: ["Crafted from sulk and a warden’s tendril, the Echoing Shulkshelf is the abyss given voice. It grants +10.00 Eterna (Max 80.00), +10.00% Quanta, and +15.00% Arcana, while also bestowing +1 Enchanting Clue—a rare gift of sight within the deep. Where the Echoing Deepshelf whispered faintly, this shelf resounds with a chorus of the abyss, its tendrils binding the ritual to powers unseen. It is both guidance and peril, a shelf that illuminates while reminding the enchanter that the abyss always hungers."]
	quest.0D57924560D3A7D5.quest_subtitle: "Resonance of deep, vision of chance."
	quest.0D61B696299C415D.quest_desc: ["An essential shelf carved from the abyss, the Deepshelf of Arcane Treasures does not merely feed the Enchantment Table with knowledge—it opens the way to rare magics. Each shelf grants +10.00 Eterna (up to 70.00), though at the cost of -15% Quanta and -15% Arcana. Yet its true gift lies in revelation: only with these shelves may Treasure Enchants be found, the hidden boons of fortune and rarity that lie beyond ordinary magic. To build with Deepshelves is to accept diminished clarity and chaos, in exchange for the chance at treasures otherwise lost to the world."]
	quest.0D61B696299C415D.quest_subtitle: "Revealer of rare arcane truths."
	quest.0E88FDAE4CB5561B.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Awakening to empower certain entities or structures through ritual magic."]
	quest.0E88FDAE4CB5561B.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Awakening ritual to unlock powerful bosses and challenges."
	quest.0E88FDAE4CB5561B.title: "Ritual of Awakening"
	quest.0EC08C5BBFA83A51.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Lightning to call down bolts of lightning as part of your spell combos."]
	quest.0EC08C5BBFA83A51.quest_subtitle: "Strike from the sky"
	quest.0EC08C5BBFA83A51.title: "Glyph: Lightning"
	quest.0F2F4999EFC7D02E.quest_desc: ["At first glance, the Stoneshelf seems inert, even detrimental. It reduces Eterna by -3.00 and Arcana by -7.50%, offering no boon of its own. Yet its purpose lies in precision: some enchantment recipes demand exact balances of Eterna, Arcana, and Quanta. Where other shelves push values higher, the Stoneshelf pulls them back, lowering the flow of magical energy and purity into the proper range. In this way, it is not a shelf of power, but of restraint—an anchor that makes rare combinations possible. To dismiss it is folly; to use it wisely is mastery."]
	quest.0F2F4999EFC7D02E.quest_subtitle: "The subtractive stones of restraint."
	quest.0F40A5D90E13E2F6.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Novice Spellbook."
		""
		"This is your personal spellcasting tool; it holds spell slots, organizes glyphs,"
		"and lets you actually cast."
		"Once crafted, open it and explore the built-in progression tabs."
	]
	quest.0F40A5D90E13E2F6.title: "The First Spellbook"
	quest.0F9CFD17E629D9C3.quest_desc: ["Etched with the essence of reforging, this template allows found gear—no matter its origin—to be bound in iron. Place your weapon, armor, or tool upon the Smithing Table, align it with the Iron Template, and watch as the forge reshapes it. Affixes and augments are preserved, yet the item is reborn in iron’s steadfast form. What was once scattered treasure now becomes a foundation of strength, unified under the mark of iron."]
	quest.0F9CFD17E629D9C3.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading To Iron!"
	quest.1000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"Arcane Essence is the core magical material used in Iron's Spells."
		"Find a piece to begin your journey into spellcasting."
	]
	quest.1000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Find your first magic resource"
	quest.1000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "First Arcane Essence"
	quest.1038054E334AC792.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Extend Time to lengthen the duration of many compatible spell effects."]
	quest.1038054E334AC792.quest_subtitle: "Longer-lasting spells"
	quest.1038054E334AC792.title: "Glyph: Extend Time"
	quest.103A16ADA011CAD7.quest_desc: ["The world itself bends beneath Apotheosis, divided into escalating tiers of danger and reward. This achievement marks your entry into that system, acknowledging that you now walk a path where each tier brings greater peril—and greater treasures. Though granted automatically, it is the foundation upon which all future trials are built. From here, the journey begins: a climb through worlds that grow ever more unforgiving, yet ever more rewarding. Press Ctrl + T to climb through the World Tiers!"]
	quest.103A16ADA011CAD7.quest_subtitle: "The first step into tiered worlds."
	quest.1106E3087EDBA434.quest_desc: [
		"Refine your conductors with Gold Wire."
		"Gold is key for more advanced power components."
	]
	quest.1106E3087EDBA434.title: "Golden Signal"
	quest.1109ECB321CAE53A.quest_desc: [
		"Using your spellbook, create a simple damage spell like:"
		"- Touch + Harm"
		""
		"Give your spell a name and icon."
		"This is your training spell: tweak it until you like how it feels."
	]
	quest.1109ECB321CAE53A.title: "Building a Simple Spell"
	quest.111649D7E16D869F.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Wand, an item that helps to direct and channel your Ars Nouveau spells."]
	quest.111649D7E16D869F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a wand to channel glyphs and spell patterns on the go."
	quest.111649D7E16D869F.title: "Ars Wand"
	quest.11A11F5125227C37.quest_subtitle: "30 days"
	quest.11A11F5125227C37.title: "True Artisan"
	quest.11ABAA40848ACDCB.quest_desc: [
		"Learn to transfer Source between jars and machines."
		""
		"Use Source Relays or similar blocks to automatically move Source around your base."
		"Your goal is to have Source automatically feeding your Imbuement Chamber and Enchanting Apparatus."
	]
	quest.11ABAA40848ACDCB.title: "Moving the Magic"
	quest.11C2D56F3D382573.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Sense Magic to locate magical blocks, effects, or structures in the world."]
	quest.11C2D56F3D382573.quest_subtitle: "Detect nearby magic"
	quest.11C2D56F3D382573.title: "Glyph: Sense Magic"
	quest.1272BAA0D98596DF.quest_subtitle: "Map out an alternate Overgrowth ritual site for your fields."
	quest.1272BAA0D98596DF.title: "Ritual of Overgrowth (Array)"
	quest.12A70E00A63A7154.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Bounce to cause entities or projectiles to bounce instead of stopping."]
	quest.12A70E00A63A7154.quest_subtitle: "Rebound projectiles or entities"
	quest.12A70E00A63A7154.title: "Glyph: Bounce"
	quest.12A947BD1B663B8D.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Blaze Forger to upgrade items, this acts as an anvil."
	quest.12A947BD1B663B8D.title: "Blaze Forging"
	quest.12A9BC53735BC976.quest_desc: ["Forged from stone and bound with crystalline essence, these slates are the foundation upon which all sigils are inscribed. Their surfaces shimmer faintly, as if the gems within whisper secrets of power. Without them, the runes of rebirth, enhancement, and transcendence cannot take form. With them, the language of magic is given a vessel—each slate a silent promise that raw materials may be shaped into destiny itself."]
	quest.12A9BC53735BC976.quest_subtitle: "A Blank Slate."
	quest.12B38AA00FCA975E.quest_desc: ["Forged in the Nether’s gaze, this shelf does not empower the Enchantment Table with knowledge, but instead sharpens the seer’s vision. Each Hellshelf of Sight grants a single clue, revealing one additional enchantment that lies upon an item—if such enchantments exist. The effect is stackable: with two shelves, two clues are shown, allowing the reader to discern whether an item bears one, two, or even three enchantments. Though it offers no strength to the books themselves, its true gift is sight—piercing the veil of hidden magic."]
	quest.12B38AA00FCA975E.quest_subtitle: "Reveals what lies unseen."
	quest.12BEE03F14067AED.quest_desc: ["An archive without equal, the Library of Alexandria gathers enchanted books into a single monument of knowledge. Like the Enchantment Library, it preserves, combines, and separates enchantments without harm—but its capacity is far greater. Here, each enchantment may be stored up to level XXXI, yet never beyond what the world itself allows. Within these shelves, the scribe’s craft reaches its pinnacle: a place where every enchantment is catalogued, refined, and made ready for destiny. It is not merely storage—it is legend, a vault of magic echoing the lost wisdom of ages."]
	quest.12BEE03F14067AED.quest_subtitle: "The pinnacle of enchanted archives."
	quest.12D0C2E5851DA892.quest_subtitle: "Your crossbow may be fired additional times per reload."
	quest.12D0C2E5851DA892.title: "Crescendo of bolts"
	quest.139383745D5E5DAB.quest_desc: [
		"Combine multiple glyphs into a single spell."
		""
		"For example:"
		"- Projectile + Harm + Amplify for extra damage"
		"- Touch + Break + Fortune for better mining"
		""
		"Your goal is to understand how glyph order and combinations change the result."
	]
	quest.139383745D5E5DAB.title: "Layered Spells"
	quest.147D146042DA00E2.quest_subtitle: "Deploy additional Restoration sites to repair damage across your world."
	quest.147D146042DA00E2.title: "Ritual of Restoration (Array)"
	quest.14DB8A515CA50932.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Enchanter's Sword, a weapon designed to pair with Ars Nouveau spellcasting."]
	quest.14DB8A515CA50932.quest_subtitle: "Forge an Enchanter’s Sword, channeling spell power into melee combat."
	quest.14DB8A515CA50932.title: "Enchanter’s Blade"
	quest.157AFCA525BBB05B.quest_desc: ["The most used vessel of Apotheosis enchanting, the table binds raw magic into form. Surrounded by shelves of knowledge, it channels enchantments into books, tools, and armor. Unlike the sigils and sockets that weave affixes, the Enchantment Table’s purpose is singular: to inscribe enchantments directly onto items or into tomes. It is the foundation of all enchanting, the first step in shaping gear with arcane power. The table now uses experience points instead of levels."]
	quest.157AFCA525BBB05B.quest_subtitle: "Where magic is first inscribed."
	quest.15D8003C7DBCCAE0.quest_desc: [
		"Wrap Copper Wire onto an Empty Spool."
