	quest.1AFB578464682213.title: "Creating your first Vault"
	quest.1B11C100F4629FDC.quest_subtitle: "Using a portable stock ticker you can request items from afar to either your name or any address in your logistics network"
	quest.1B11C100F4629FDC.title: "Remotely Requesting Packages"
	quest.1B2E6B141B5E7F2B.quest_desc: [
		"Build an Alternator to convert Create's kinetic stress"
		"into Forge Energy for your new power network."
	]
	quest.1B2E6B141B5E7F2B.quest_subtitle: "Alternator"
	quest.1B2E6B141B5E7F2B.title: "Turning Stress into FE"
	quest.1B530E0097F3E0CC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a basic spell scroll using the Scroll Forge, ink, paper, and a focus item."
		"Once crafted, you can inscribe it into your spell book at the Inscription Table."
	]
	quest.1B530E0097F3E0CC.quest_subtitle: "Ready to cast"
	quest.1B530E0097F3E0CC.title: "First Spell Scroll"
	quest.1BA546CA4F4577E4.quest_desc: [
		"Casting spells uses Mana, a personal resource that regenerates over time."
		""
		"Experiment with your new spell until you learn how quickly your mana drains and refills."
		"Try not to spam spells pointlessly – smart casting is part of a good mage’s discipline."
	]
	quest.1BA546CA4F4577E4.title: "Mana and You"
	quest.1C95A3B8A34A4480.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Imbuement Chamber to create at least one useful magical component,"
		"such as Sourcegems or Arcane Stone."
		""
		"These items are the backbone of almost every Ars Nouveau machine and upgrade."
	]
	quest.1C95A3B8A34A4480.title: "Practical Imbuements"
	quest.1D0FBC4EC22C076D.quest_desc: [
		"Not every spell has to blow things up."
		""
		"Create a utility spell that helps with everyday tasks:"
		"examples include Light, Blink, Grow, Harvest, or Regenerate."
		"Try to make a spell that you’ll actually use while exploring or building."
	]
	quest.1D0FBC4EC22C076D.title: "Utility over Destruction"
	quest.1D107A1858235B3A.quest_desc: ["Though simple in form, candles radiate more than light. Each flame carries a trace of Arcana, the essence of ethereal purity. Arcana makes rare enchantments more common and increases the number of enchantments that may appear. A single candle grants +1.25% Arcana, its glow weaving subtle threads of magic into the Enchantment Table’s ritual. Place them in numbers, and the purity of enchantments grows brighter, guiding the scribe toward rarer and fuller outcomes. Candles do not strengthen Eterna or temper Quanta—they are devoted solely to Arcana, the purity that shapes enchantments into abundance."]
	quest.1D107A1858235B3A.quest_subtitle: "The flame that teaches Arcana’s truth."
	quest.1D3471FCA8B3BE36.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Summon Steed to conjure a rideable mount wherever you need one."]
	quest.1D3471FCA8B3BE36.quest_subtitle: "A mount on demand"
	quest.1D3471FCA8B3BE36.title: "Glyph: Summon Steed"
	quest.1D4E6AA5AF5954E5.quest_desc: [
		"Poison spells use Poisonous Potatoes to represent venom and decay."
		"Acquire a poisonous potato to brew toxic magic against your foes."
	]
	quest.1D4E6AA5AF5954E5.title: "Poison Focus – Poisonous Potato"
	quest.1D4EC548B637CF04.quest_desc: ["Gleaming with the luster of ancient wealth, this template allows found gear—bearing affixes and augments—to be transmuted into gold. Place your weapon, armor, or tool upon the Smithing Table, align it with the Golden Template, and watch as radiant flame reshapes it. The item’s powers remain intact, yet its form is reborn in gold’s shining brilliance. What was once ordinary treasure now becomes a symbol of opulence and arcane prestige."]
	quest.1D4EC548B637CF04.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading To Gold!"
	quest.1D86B2E553503E53.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Dominion Wand to manage your summoned familiars, golems, and other magical constructs."]
	quest.1D86B2E553503E53.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Dominion Wand to control familiars and magical machines."
	quest.1D86B2E553503E53.title: "Dominion Wand"
	quest.1DEC6861FD0BAB07.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Imbuement Chamber to create at least one useful magical component,"
		"such as Arcane Stone or additional Sourcegems."
		""
		"These items are the backbone of almost every Ars Nouveau machine and upgrade."
	]
	quest.1DEC6861FD0BAB07.title: "Practical Imbuements"
	quest.1E3FE3F6C95FFF55.quest_subtitle: "Craft nuggets together into blocks for storage."
	quest.1E3FE3F6C95FFF55.title: "XP in Bulk"
	quest.1EAE42D3A2162339.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Break to let your spells mine and break blocks directly."]
	quest.1EAE42D3A2162339.quest_subtitle: "Mining with magic"
	quest.1EAE42D3A2162339.title: "Glyph: Break"
	quest.1EEC5622F2A9A163.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Pickup to pull nearby items into inventories or towards you using spells."]
	quest.1EEC5622F2A9A163.quest_subtitle: "Collect items magically"
	quest.1EEC5622F2A9A163.title: "Glyph: Pickup"
	quest.1F2D8BD8D1E4EF78.quest_subtitle: "Added Enchantments from the Apotheosis mod."
	quest.1F2F37B81A60900B.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Fishing is bound exclusively to the enchantments of the rod. It accepts only magics that enhance the art of angling—whether granting luck, lure, or durability. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their fishing rod becomes more than a simple tool: it becomes a conduit of patience and providence, drawing treasures from the depths with precision. It is a tome of calm waters, a record of enchantments meant to guide the fisher’s hand in pursuit of the unseen."]
	quest.1F2F37B81A60900B.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the rod."
	quest.1F6D77CEFA54B61C.quest_desc: [
		"Magic Cloth is used to sew robes and other caster armor pieces."
		"Gather enough cloth to start preparing your first spellcaster outfit."
	]
	quest.1F6D77CEFA54B61C.quest_subtitle: "Weave magical fabric"
	quest.1F6D77CEFA54B61C.title: "Magic Cloth"
	quest.2000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"The official Iron's Spells guidebook explains every system in the mod."
		"Obtain a copy so you can look up recipes, schools, and mechanics."
	]
	quest.2000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Read the manual!"
	quest.2000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Iron's Spellbook Guide"
	quest.20CA67B49F5E7EDF.quest_desc: ["Through ritual infusion, Dragon’s Breath is transmuted into a stable form, its chaos tempered by the enchantment table. The Infused Dragon’s Breath becomes a cornerstone of End‑born shelves, channeling the void’s resonance with precision. It is the dragon’s flame refined, a vessel of silence and power that anchors enchantments to the infinite horizon."]
	quest.20CA67B49F5E7EDF.quest_subtitle: "Infusion of the end."
	quest.20ECB79222C2045F.quest_desc: ["Inscribed upon Gem-Fused Slate, this sigil carries the quiet power of erasure. When invoked upon the Smithing Table, it strips away the name bestowed upon affixed gear found across the world. The item’s augments and affixes remain untouched, yet its title fades into silence, leaving only the raw essence of the artifact behind. Each sigil is a ritual of forgetting, a return to purity, where the gear stands unbound by identity and ready to be reshaped anew."]
	quest.20ECB79222C2045F.quest_subtitle: "Erase the mark, keep the might."
	quest.2177ED03168103CC.quest_desc: ["Infused within the enchantment table through a ritual of water and wisdom, the Infused Seashelf is a refined evolution of its oceanic predecessor. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 60.00) and +5.00% Arcana, deepening the ritual’s energy and insight. Its surface shimmers with enchantment, echoing the stillness of the abyss and the clarity of moonlit tides. This shelf does not roar—it whispers, guiding the seer with calm precision toward hidden truths. It is a shelf of mastery, born from the sea’s silence and the ritual’s spark."]
	quest.2177ED03168103CC.quest_subtitle: "Infusion of sea, clarity of chance."
	quest.21A278F64F7FD633.quest_subtitle: "18 days"
	quest.21A278F64F7FD633.title: "Steamwright"
	quest.21EC1A577B4E2FC4.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Warping to teleport players or entities between linked ritual sites."]
	quest.21EC1A577B4E2FC4.quest_subtitle: "Create the Ritual of Warping to bend space and relocate players or entities."
	quest.21EC1A577B4E2FC4.title: "Ritual of Warping"
	quest.2223C15BD1624A02.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Enchanting Apparatus to craft something meaningful to your progression:"
		"perhaps an upgraded spellbook, a new glyph, or a utility item."
		""
		"Watch how Source is consumed during the crafting – you’ll be doing this often."
	]
	quest.2223C15BD1624A02.title: "A Ritual of Crafting"
	quest.223DC8EF43162582.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Enchanting Apparatus and surround it with Arcane Pedestals."
		""
		"This structure lets you perform more advanced crafting recipes that combine items and Source."
		"Think of it as your magical crafting altar."
	]
	quest.223DC8EF43162582.title: "The Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.227DBA8836021B0B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Source Jar to store and move Source, the magical fuel used by Ars Nouveau devices."]
	quest.227DBA8836021B0B.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Source Jar to store the magical energy you generate."
	quest.227DBA8836021B0B.title: "Source in a Jar"
	quest.22DA0C145FBCEC1C.quest_subtitle: "Break down Super XP Blocks into nuggets."
	quest.22DA0C145FBCEC1C.title: "Super Nuggets"
	quest.2302EC2EB1A05908.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Ring of Potential as a base for many powerful accessories."
	quest.2302EC2EB1A05908.title: "Ring of Potential"
	quest.2327B3FAF11FCFD5.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Imbuement Chamber."
		""
		"This block lets you convert mundane items into magical materials,"
		"such as Sourcegems and other components."
		"Place it near your Source generation so it always has fuel."
	]
	quest.2327B3FAF11FCFD5.title: "Imbuement Chamber Basics"
	quest.23A986B0E9E852E6.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock a powerful late-game glyph."
		""
		"Integrate it into a new spell designed around that glyph’s strength:"
		"make something that really shows off your magical power."
	]
	quest.23A986B0E9E852E6.title: "High-Tier Glyphs"
	quest.23AF3FC77C95DA4D.quest_desc: [
		"Magic starts with a book."
		"Obtain the Worn Notebook from Ars Nouveau."
		""
		"This ancient journal is filled with half-faded notes, recipes, and strange glyphs."
		"Use it as your in-game guide for spells, machines, and more."
	]
	quest.23AF3FC77C95DA4D.title: "A Curious Tome"
	quest.23C4AD3E6AF67325.quest_subtitle: "Wool recived is doubled, but the sheep takes damage."
	quest.23C4AD3E6AF67325.title: "Worker Exploitation"
	quest.23CAB715665FA475.quest_subtitle: "Automate spellcasting by crafting a Basic Spell Turret."
	quest.23CAB715665FA475.title: "Basic Spell Turret"
	quest.251C9E4B29A29728.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Restoration to repair damaged blocks and structures within its range."]
	quest.251C9E4B29A29728.quest_subtitle: "Repair the world, healing terrain and structures through magic."
	quest.251C9E4B29A29728.title: "Ritual of Restoration"
	quest.252C2E03E25D0912.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Fire set to cloak yourself in flame and fury."
	quest.252C2E03E25D0912.title: "Fire Elemental Vestments"
	quest.25330BF0BE5CF965.quest_subtitle: "Craft the air-aligned Ars Elemental set to dance on the winds of magic."
	quest.25330BF0BE5CF965.title: "Air Elemental Vestments"
	quest.2546C3D1F0677AAC.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Gems!"
	quest.2546C3D1F0677AAC.title: "Gems!"
	quest.256C1A7CF9028C53.quest_desc: [
		"Void spells use Echo Shards found in ancient, echoing structures."
		"Secure an Echo Shard to tap into the power of the void."
	]
	quest.256C1A7CF9028C53.title: "Void Focus – Echo Shard"
	quest.2643936F1C10500D.quest_subtitle: "I have no godly clue how to get this, if you do, let an admin know. And if you figure it out, ur rich."
	quest.26D2183E27E1273A.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Scrying to view distant locations or entities using ritual magic."]
	quest.26D2183E27E1273A.quest_subtitle: "Peer across distances and dimensions with the Ritual of Scrying."
	quest.26D2183E27E1273A.title: "Ritual of Scrying"
	quest.2714EE46B4DF620E.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Summon Vex to conjure vex spirits that can harass your enemies."]
	quest.2714EE46B4DF620E.quest_subtitle: "Call forth spectral allies"
	quest.2714EE46B4DF620E.title: "Glyph: Summon Vex"
	quest.27A4530B2B62E1D1.quest_subtitle: "Establish another Moonfall ritual to control night cycles across your base."
	quest.27A4530B2B62E1D1.title: "Ritual of Moonfall (Array)"
	quest.2822A438CF883B94.quest_desc: ["Crafted from shulk and a warden’s tendril, the Soul‑Touched Shulkshelf embodies the abyss at its most perilous. It grants +10.00 Eterna (Max 80.00), +15.00% Quanta, and +10.00% Arcana, while also bestowing +1 Enchanting Clue—a rare flicker of guidance amid chaos. Where the Soul‑Touched Deepshelf whispered danger, this advanced form roars with it, binding enchantments to the restless flame of the soul. Its glow is cold, its resonance unsettling, a shelf that tempts the enchanter with power while reminding them that the abyss always exacts a price."]
	quest.2822A438CF883B94.quest_subtitle: "Soul of deep, fate of chance."
	quest.285B07492DFAED9C.quest_subtitle: "Maintain multiple Fertility ritual sites for large-scale farms."
	quest.285B07492DFAED9C.title: "Ritual of Fertility (Array)"
	quest.28D825F9E9E0D797.quest_desc: ["Wrought from the essence of Apothic Invaders, this sigil bears runes of ruin and hunger. When invoked upon the Smithing Table, it demands a sacrifice—one affix, chosen at random, is stripped away. In its place, the Touch of Malice awakens, surging raw strength into the item’s core. Weapons strike with cruel efficiency, armor hardens with grim resilience, and tools bite deeper into the world. Uncraftable by mortal hands, each sigil is a shard of hostile will, a trophy of conquest that twists power through loss."]
	quest.28D825F9E9E0D797.quest_subtitle: "Use at your own peril."
	quest.28D9ED74EBBC9818.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Wilden Summon to call forth Wilden creatures for combat or resource farming."]
	quest.28D9ED74EBBC9818.quest_subtitle: "Call forth the Wilden to test your combat prowess and gather rare drops."
	quest.28D9ED74EBBC9818.title: "Ritual of Wilden Summoning"
	quest.28E0944FF83CDAF0.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Enchanting Template with XP blocks."
	quest.28E0944FF83CDAF0.title: "Basic Templates"
	quest.290F943A1FF52070.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Pierce to let projectiles pass through multiple targets or blocks."]
	quest.290F943A1FF52070.quest_subtitle: "Penetrating shots"
	quest.290F943A1FF52070.title: "Glyph: Pierce"
	quest.295703FC5B92D0E6.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Slowfall to soften falls and keep yourself safe from fall damage while casting spells."]
	quest.295703FC5B92D0E6.quest_subtitle: "Float gently downward"
	quest.295703FC5B92D0E6.title: "Glyph: Slowfall"
	quest.295C77EEC89000FC.quest_desc: ["Acquire a Vitalic Sourcelink to generate Source using players' or mobs' vitality and healing."]
	quest.295C77EEC89000FC.quest_subtitle: "Convert living energy—health and regeneration—into Source."
	quest.295C77EEC89000FC.title: "Vitalic Sourcelink"
	quest.29742AAF8DF419BF.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Toss to throw or lob items and entities with your spells."]
	quest.29742AAF8DF419BF.quest_subtitle: "Throw items or entities"
	quest.29742AAF8DF419BF.title: "Glyph: Toss"
	quest.29942A892E874172.quest_subtitle: "Makes all arrows infinite."
	quest.29942A892E874172.title: "Endless Quiver"
	quest.299995726B9984A5.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your Arcanist armor to tier 3"
	quest.299995726B9984A5.title: "Arcanist T3"
	quest.29AB79923BB5A37E.quest_desc: ["Born from shards and the Heart of the Sea, the Heart‑Forged Seashelf is a relic of oceanic might. It grants +15.00 Eterna (Max 60.00) and +20.00% Arcana, flooding the ritual with unparalleled energy and insight. Unlike its crystalline kin, this shelf is not merely luminous—it is alive, pulsing with the rhythm of the ocean’s heart. To craft it is to bind oneself to the tides, wielding the sea’s eternal pulse as a guide through enchantment. It is a shelf of destiny, forged in the abyss, carrying the weight of the ocean’s soul."]
	quest.29AB79923BB5A37E.quest_subtitle: "Mastery of sea, heart of chance."
	quest.29E3DD9A3F85CE80.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Summon Decoy to create decoy entities that draw enemy attention away from you."]
	quest.29E3DD9A3F85CE80.quest_subtitle: "Distract your enemies"
	quest.29E3DD9A3F85CE80.title: "Glyph: Summon Decoy"
	quest.2AA5D098ADB3212B.quest_desc: ["Crafted from an Infused Hellshelf and glowstone, the Glowing Hellshelf radiates with arcane brilliance. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 60.00), +5.00% Quanta, and +3.33% Arcana, making it a balanced shelf of energy, chaos, and insight. Where the base shelf channels flame and chance, this variant adds clarity—its glow revealing deeper truths within the enchantment ritual. It is a shelf of refinement, born from fire and light, guiding enchantments toward precision and power."]
	quest.2AA5D098ADB3212B.quest_subtitle: "Mastery of hell, glowing with chance."
	quest.2C0B229B17436939.quest_desc: ["Pinnacle is the summit beyond all summits, the final tier where legends are forged. To unlock it, you must equip a full set of Epic armor, wield a Epic weapon, and slay the Ender Dragon, the ultimate adversary. Within Pinnacle, only rare, epic, and mythic powers remain—common and uncommon magics have vanished entirely. Gems gleam with near‑perfect purity: flawless shards dominate, and perfect gems shine as rare treasures of absolute brilliance. Adventurers ascend with +125% experience gained and +100% luck, yet monsters rise as near‑immortal foes, bearing +16 armor, +20 armor toughness, +25 armor pierce, and +20 protection pierce. Pinnacle is not merely a tier—it is Apotheosis itself, the realm where destiny is decided and only the greatest endure."]
	quest.2C0B229B17436939.quest_subtitle: "The final tier, where legends are crowned."
	quest.2C47C9B566A63135.quest_desc: ["Acquire a Whirlisprig Charm to automate the harvesting and gathering of plant resources."]
	quest.2C47C9B566A63135.quest_subtitle: "Create a Whirlisprig Charm to automate plant harvesting and collection."
	quest.2C47C9B566A63135.title: "Whirlisprig Worker"
	quest.2C714C614AECA67E.quest_desc: [
		"Bloody Vellum is a sturdier scroll base for more powerful spells."
		"Upgrade from plain paper to vellum to handle stronger magic safely."
	]
	quest.2C714C614AECA67E.quest_subtitle: "Write on something stronger"
	quest.2C714C614AECA67E.title: "Bloody Vellum"
	quest.2CAB9B9ECD525AD7.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Imbuement Chamber."
		""
		"This block lets you convert mundane items into magical materials,"
		"such as Sourcegems and other components."
		"Place it near your Source generation so it always has fuel."
	]
	quest.2CAB9B9ECD525AD7.title: "Imbuement Chamber Basics"
	quest.2CD1B2BCEDA0D473.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Exchange to swap blocks or entities between locations with your spells."]
	quest.2CD1B2BCEDA0D473.quest_subtitle: "Swap blocks or positions"
	quest.2CD1B2BCEDA0D473.title: "Glyph: Exchange"
	quest.2D0CF18C8B2ABB7D.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Agronomic Sourcelink to generate Source using crops and plant growth or harvesting."]
	quest.2D0CF18C8B2ABB7D.quest_subtitle: "Harvest Source from crop growth and farming activities."
	quest.2D0CF18C8B2ABB7D.title: "Agronomic Sourcelink"
	quest.2DD7BAE377A3F46A.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Others is a book bound to the enchantments that do not fit neatly into weapon, armor, or tool categories. It accepts the strange and the overlooked: tridents, shears, hoes, shields, and other miscellaneous gear. Where most tomes specialize in a single discipline, this one embraces the oddities, ensuring that even the most unconventional items find a place in the enchanting order. It is a tome of versatility, a safeguard against neglect, and a reminder that every tool of the adventurer carries its own spark of magic."]
	quest.2DD7BAE377A3F46A.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the untaged."
	quest.2EB1FACE37A11168.quest_subtitle: "Add a mob to a seat next to a stock ticker to create a stock keeper"
	quest.2EB1FACE37A11168.title: "Creating a Logistics network"
	quest.2EB88ABC7017D5FE.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Interact to allow spells to right-click or activate blocks and entities automatically."]
	quest.2EB88ABC7017D5FE.quest_subtitle: "Use blocks with spells"
	quest.2EB88ABC7017D5FE.title: "Glyph: Interact"
	quest.2F5AECF5CDC8D8DB.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Sensitive to allow spells to respond to smaller or more precise triggers in the world."]
	quest.2F5AECF5CDC8D8DB.quest_subtitle: "Trigger on subtle events"
	quest.2F5AECF5CDC8D8DB.title: "Glyph: Sensitive"
	quest.2F9EBCB7BB6A6F94.quest_desc: [
		"Wrap Gold Wire into a Gold Spool."
		"Used in higher-tier power conversion machines."
	]
	quest.2F9EBCB7BB6A6F94.title: "Golden Spooling"
	quest.2FD997F7CA0FEE89.quest_subtitle: "Sheep have a 50% chance to instantly regrow their wool."
	quest.2FD997F7CA0FEE89.title: "Growth Serum"
	quest.3000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"The Inscription Table is where you socket spells into your spellbook."
		"Craft one so you can manage your spell loadout safely at base."
	]
	quest.3000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Manage your spells"
	quest.3000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Inscription Table"
	quest.30877432D1026706.quest_subtitle: "0 days"
	quest.30877432D1026706.title: "Pioneer"
	quest.30B8E8169EAE1C01.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Heal to mend your wounds or those of allies using spellcasting."]
	quest.30B8E8169EAE1C01.quest_subtitle: "Restore health with magic"
	quest.30B8E8169EAE1C01.title: "Glyph: Heal"
	quest.311E9A6E50A89E57.quest_subtitle: "Combine mundane weaponry and magic with the Spell Crossbow."
	quest.311E9A6E50A89E57.title: "Spell Crossbow"
	quest.3182E8AF755104E4.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Enchanter's Shield, a defensive focus that works alongside your spells."]
	quest.3182E8AF755104E4.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Enchanter’s Shield to deflect attacks with arcane energy."
	quest.3182E8AF755104E4.title: "Enchanter’s Shield"
	quest.319A26FA8D533B7F.quest_subtitle: "Craft using nuggets and glass to make a lantern to absorb xp."
	quest.319A26FA8D533B7F.title: "Light of Experience"
	quest.329B7554AE16FFF7.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Phantom Block to create short-lived blocks you can stand on with your spells."]
	quest.329B7554AE16FFF7.quest_subtitle: "Temporary walkways"
	quest.329B7554AE16FFF7.title: "Glyph: Phantom Block"
	quest.33682F4B44950123.quest_desc: ["Use a filter or gather Archwood logs to begin working with Ars Nouveau’s magical trees."]
	quest.33682F4B44950123.quest_subtitle: "Harvest Blue Archwood to begin working with magical wood and saplings."
	quest.33682F4B44950123.title: "Archwood Discovery"
	quest.34126E5B74E7F49C.quest_subtitle: "Another arrangement of the Sunrise ritual for your ritual network."
	quest.34126E5B74E7F49C.title: "Ritual of Sunrise (Array)"
	quest.34339E9BF4FAA8F3.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Leggings is bound exclusively to the enchantments of lower armor. It accepts only magics that strengthen mobility, resilience, and defense—whether granting protection against blows, resistance to elements, or enhancements to movement. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their leggings become a foundation of stability, guarding the bearer’s stride and fortifying their path through danger. It is a tome of balance, a record of enchantments meant to shield the adventurer’s steps."]
	quest.34339E9BF4FAA8F3.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the legs."
	quest.348BDC2F0F40B899.quest_desc: ["Awakened within the enchantment table, the Infused Deepshelf is the first true stirring of the abyss. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 70.00), +5.00% Quanta, and +5.00% Arcana, weaving energy, chaos, and insight into a single current. Where the Dormant Deepshelf whispered of hidden promise, the Infused variant begins to reveal its depth—its surface shimmering like dark waters lit by unseen stars. It is a shelf of awakening, a herald of the abyss’s greater power yet to come."]
	quest.348BDC2F0F40B899.quest_subtitle: "Infusion of deep, surge of chance."
	quest.34A173721735401B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Wixie Charm to unlock a magical crafter that can help with automated crafting setups."]
	quest.34A173721735401B.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Wixie Charm and put a tiny spellcaster to work on your automation."
	quest.34A173721735401B.title: "Wixie Artisan"
	quest.34DC34EA5ED7C96D.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Moonfall to shift the world’s time toward night using ritual magic."]
	quest.34DC34EA5ED7C96D.quest_subtitle: "Summon the moonlit sky at will by performing this celestial ritual."
	quest.34DC34EA5ED7C96D.title: "Ritual of Moonfall"
	quest.3585F72CA464D269.quest_subtitle: "Condense the strength of rivers and oceans into Water Essence."
	quest.3585F72CA464D269.title: "Water Essence"
	quest.36183375DAA54408.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Invisibility to make yourself or others vanish from view with your spells."]
	quest.36183375DAA54408.quest_subtitle: "Fade from sight"
	quest.36183375DAA54408.title: "Glyph: Invisibility"
	quest.3678F8B79AFD7B04.quest_desc: [
		"Integrate Ars Nouveau with other mods in your pack."
		""
		"Use Source, spells, or automation to:"
		"- Assist with resource generation"
		"- Improve farms"
		"- Enhance storage or transport systems"
		""
		"A good mage uses magic to make everything else easier."
	]
	quest.3678F8B79AFD7B04.title: "Synergy with Technology"
	quest.36ACCF555802D6F9.quest_desc: ["Within these shelves lies order amidst chaos. The Enchantment Library gathers every enchanted book into a single archive, preserving their power without limit of number. Each enchantment may be stored up to level XVI, yet never beyond what the world itself allows—no impossible strength may be drawn from its pages. Here, enchantments can be combined into greater volumes or carefully separated without harm, unraveling books that hold many magics into their pure forms. Looting and Fortune, once bound together, may be parted cleanly, each preserved in its own tome. The Library is not merely storage—it is the scribe’s forge, where enchantments are catalogued, refined, and made ready for destiny."]
	quest.36ACCF555802D6F9.quest_subtitle: "The foundation of enchanted archives."
	quest.3708C1B9419DA999.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Rolling Mill to begin producing rods, wires, and other"
		"components used throughout Create Crafts and Additions."
	]
	quest.3708C1B9419DA999.title: "Rolling Start"
	quest.37D0F6B3EA23B0AB.quest_subtitle: "Signs can be used on a packager to automatically set the package address"
	quest.37D0F6B3EA23B0AB.title: "Addressing Packages"
	quest.3801E818308438FF.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: AOE to expand your spell effects to cover an area instead of a single target."]
	quest.3801E818308438FF.quest_subtitle: "Affect a wider area"
	quest.3801E818308438FF.title: "Glyph: Area of Effect"
	quest.38B7A194722637D7.quest_desc: ["Frontier marks the threshold where safety fades and true challenge begins. To unlock it, you must equip a full common set of armor and a weapon, proving your readiness to step beyond Haven’s shelter. Here, uncommon magics dominate the drops, rare enchantments flicker into reach, and even epic power whispers at the edges. Gems grow sturdier—flawed and normal purities emerge among the cracked and chipped. The world itself shifts: adventurers gain +35% experience and +20% luck, while monsters harden with +4 armor, demanding sharper skill and stronger resolve. Frontier is the proving ground, where the balance of risk and reward first tilts toward danger."]
	quest.38B7A194722637D7.quest_subtitle: "The second tier, where challenge begins."
	quest.38E33877CDB9F1F0.quest_desc: [
		"Build a Modular Accumulator multiblock to store energy."
		"Scale it up to buffer large FE networks."
	]
	quest.38E33877CDB9F1F0.quest_subtitle: "Accumulator"
	quest.38E33877CDB9F1F0.title: "Banking Your Power"
	quest.38E44223347DA798.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Place Block so your spells can place blocks from inventories in the world."]
	quest.38E44223347DA798.quest_subtitle: "Build with magic"
	quest.38E44223347DA798.title: "Glyph: Place Block"
	quest.392869A1DEB7EE20.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Pull to drag entities or items toward a target location using magic."]
	quest.392869A1DEB7EE20.quest_subtitle: "Draw objects toward you"
	quest.392869A1DEB7EE20.title: "Glyph: Pull"
	quest.3A44DCF5B7D5024C.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Ender Inventory to access ender storage from anywhere using spells."]
	quest.3A44DCF5B7D5024C.quest_subtitle: "Access your ender chest"
	quest.3A44DCF5B7D5024C.title: "Glyph: Ender Inventory"
	quest.3A9D530400619BA1.quest_desc: ["Carved with precision and bound in crystalline brilliance, this template allows found gear—bearing affixes and augments—to be reborn in diamond. Place your weapon, armor, or tool upon the Smithing Table, align it with the Diamond Template, and watch as the forge’s radiant power reshapes it. The item’s strength and magic remain intact, yet its form ascends into diamond’s unyielding purity. What was once treasure now becomes a relic of resilience, gleaming with unmatched endurance."]
	quest.3A9D530400619BA1.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading To Diamond!"
	quest.3B5DD55531046D96.title: "Chromatic Compound"
	quest.3C89D7A059FE731B.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Pickaxes is bound exclusively to the enchantments of mining tools. It accepts only magics that empower the pickaxe—whether granting efficiency, fortune, durability, or other enhancements tied to the act of breaking stone and ore. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their pickaxe becomes a precise instrument of excavation, turning raw effort into mastery of the earth’s hidden treasures. It is a tome of labor and reward, a record of enchantments meant to shape the world beneath your feet."]
	quest.3C89D7A059FE731B.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the mine."
	quest.3CC170112CA4970B.quest_desc: ["Forged from a soul lantern and shulk, the Soul‑Touched Deepshelf hums with the resonance of the abyss. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 75.00) and a formidable +15.00% Quanta, flooding enchantments with volatility and risk. Where the Echoing Deepshelf whispers guidance, this shelf strips it away, binding the ritual to the restless voices of the soul flame. Its glow is cold, its presence unsettling—a reminder that the abyss does not merely empower, it consumes. To wield it is to gamble with the deep itself."]
	quest.3CC170112CA4970B.quest_subtitle: "Soul of deep, peril of chance."
	quest.3CD186EF71A64E40.quest_desc: ["Formed from an Infused Seashelf and prismarine crystals, the Crystalline Seashelf refracts enchantment through the lens of the deep. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 60.00), +3.00% Quanta, and +5.00% Arcana, blending energy, chaos, and clarity into a single radiant shelf. Its surface glimmers with submerged brilliance, echoing the secrets of the ocean floor. This shelf does not simply guide—it illuminates, casting enchantments in shimmering patterns that ripple through the ritual like light through water."]
	quest.3CD186EF71A64E40.quest_subtitle: "Mastery of sea, radiant with chance."
	quest.3D00118E2760D129.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Name to tag entities or structures with a magical name for interaction."]
	quest.3D00118E2760D129.quest_subtitle: "Assign identities"
	quest.3D00118E2760D129.title: "Glyph: Name"
	quest.3D4D88B8BE881351.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Scribes' Table to begin researching and unlocking glyphs for your spellbook."]
	quest.3D4D88B8BE881351.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Scribe’s Table to manage and inscribe your spell recipes."
	quest.3D4D88B8BE881351.title: "The Scribe’s Table"
	quest.3D5C13FBDB6E2701.quest_desc: ["Crafted from ender pearls and end rods, the Pearlescent Endshelf radiates with the strange brilliance of the End. It grants +10.00 Eterna (Max 90.00), +7.50% Quanta, and +7.50% Arcana, weaving stability, chaos, and insight into a single luminous form. Its surface glows faintly, like starlight trapped within crystal, guiding enchantments with the elegance of the void’s horizon. To wield it is to hold a fragment of the End’s infinite shimmer, a shelf that balances danger with clarity."]
	quest.3D5C13FBDB6E2701.quest_subtitle: "Pearl of end, shimmer of chance."
	quest.3D5E9AD51D4D829A.quest_subtitle: "Set up another arena for ritually summoned combat trials."
	quest.3D5E9AD51D4D829A.title: "Ritual of Challenge (Array)"
	quest.3D862A3D3F83CA26.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Enchanting Apparatus and an Arcane Core to begin advanced magical crafting."]
	quest.3D862A3D3F83CA26.quest_subtitle: "Build an Enchanting Apparatus and Arcane Core to begin advanced crafting."
	quest.3D862A3D3F83CA26.title: "Arcane Workshop"
	quest.3E1F76F3F2A84F53.quest_desc: [
		"Refine Biomass into Bioethanol, a powerful liquid fuel"
		"for Blaze Burners and other compatible machines."
	]
	quest.3E1F76F3F2A84F53.quest_subtitle: "Bioethanol"
	quest.3E1F76F3F2A84F53.title: "Liquid Biofuel"
	quest.3EAC7600113F9AAB.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Gust to push entities or items away using a blast of air."]
	quest.3EAC7600113F9AAB.quest_subtitle: "Push with air"
	quest.3EAC7600113F9AAB.title: "Glyph: Gust"
	quest.3FB10313F3353D36.quest_desc: ["Etched upon Gem-Fused Slate, this sigil carries the power to open hidden pathways within your gear. When invoked upon the Smithing Table, it carves a new socket into weapon, armor, or tool—an empty vessel awaiting the touch of another Gem. Each sigil is a key to deeper potential, expanding the item’s destiny beyond its original design. With every socket added, the weave of magic grows more intricate, binding steel and spell into greater harmony."]
	quest.3FB10313F3353D36.quest_subtitle: "Another vessel awaits."
	quest.3FC5D00820D41017.quest_desc: [
		"Ink decides the rarity and strength of scrolls made in the Scroll Forge."
		"Brew a bottle of Common Ink as your first scroll fuel."
	]
	quest.3FC5D00820D41017.quest_subtitle: "Fuel for scroll crafting"
	quest.3FC5D00820D41017.title: "Common Ink"
	quest.4000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"To cast spells, you must equip a spell book in your off-hand or hotbar."
		"Complete the advancement for equipping a spell book for the first time."
	]
	quest.4000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "A home for your spells"
	quest.4000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Equip a Spell Book"
	quest.400AB3E8FEDE292A.quest_desc: ["Haven is the first step into the tiered worlds of Apotheosis. To unlock it, you must simply pick up any affix item, marking your entry into a realm where enchantments and gems begin to shape destiny. Haven is a place of safety and learning—where adventurers encounter common and uncommon magics in abundance, and rare treasures only sparingly. The gems found here are cracked and chipped, flawed echoes of greater purity, yet they serve as the foundation for all journeys to come. Haven is not the end, but the beginning: a world where the spark of Apotheosis first takes root."]
	quest.400AB3E8FEDE292A.quest_subtitle: "The first tier, where magic begins."
	quest.40407D2CDC660866.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Disintegration to break down blocks or structures in a powerful ritual effect."]
	quest.40407D2CDC660866.quest_subtitle: "Reduce blocks to dust and essence with this destructive ritual."
	quest.40407D2CDC660866.title: "Ritual of Disintegration"
	quest.4043B676CC3C2E35.quest_desc: ["The Gem Cutting Table is no ordinary workbench—it is a sanctum of transformation. Lay down two identical gems, scatter dust like stardust across its surface, and offer a material of higher tier as tribute. In the quiet hum of unseen forces, the gems merge, ascending into a greater form. What was once common now gleams with higher magic, a jewel reborn."]
	quest.4043B676CC3C2E35.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading Your Gems!"
	quest.407AD700892ADBF1.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Decelerate to reduce the speed of entities, projectiles, or processes."]
	quest.407AD700892ADBF1.quest_subtitle: "Slow things down"
	quest.407AD700892ADBF1.title: "Glyph: Decelerate"
	quest.40BC67BDEE15D1DE.quest_desc: ["Obtain Source Gems, a key resource produced from mundane materials via Imbuement."]
	quest.40BC67BDEE15D1DE.quest_subtitle: "Refine Source into Source Gems, a central currency of your magical crafting."
	quest.40BC67BDEE15D1DE.title: "Source Gems"
	quest.40D6A2BADE03D0CD.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade to Iron Wire for stronger, more durable conductors."
		"These will see use in structural and defensive components."
	]
	quest.40D6A2BADE03D0CD.title: "Tougher Lines"
	quest.4122F17879FE3CB0.quest_subtitle: "Prepare to craft elemental foci by mastering accessory crafting."
	quest.4122F17879FE3CB0.title: "Elemental Foci"
	quest.41813DF4422C6DE5.quest_subtitle: "Create a Lesser Fire Focus to channel the magic of flame."
	quest.41813DF4422C6DE5.title: "Lesser Fire Focus"
	quest.41A0BE357C8A74E1.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Alchemical Sourcelink to convert potions and brewed items into Source."]
	quest.41A0BE357C8A74E1.quest_subtitle: "Generate Source by consuming potions and alchemical brews."
	quest.41A0BE357C8A74E1.title: "Alchemical Sourcelink"
	quest.41E7A1DE48D3FCB1.quest_subtitle: "We upgrade ranks automatically based on time played, this is tracked through the players statistics menu"
	quest.41E9C4483554E117.quest_subtitle: "24 days"
	quest.41E9C4483554E117.title: "Innovator"
	quest.426A8B4E267E09E1.quest_desc: ["At first glance, the Dormant Deepshelf is no stronger than a simple bookshelf, granting only +2.00 Eterna (Max 30.00). Yet beneath its quiet surface lies immense potential. Forged from the abyss, it slumbers in waiting—its true strength revealed only through higher tiers of awakening. Where other shelves offer immediate clarity or chaos, the Dormant Deepshelf whispers of power untapped, a promise of the deep that grows ever more formidable as it ascends. It is a shelf of patience, a seed of the abyss destined to bloom into overwhelming might."]
	quest.426A8B4E267E09E1.quest_subtitle: "Foundation of deep, promise of chance."
	quest.4294EAF416C8B172.quest_subtitle: "Entices near by farm animals."
	quest.4294EAF416C8B172.title: "Temptation"
	quest.4295FFE533400262.quest_subtitle: "Cut the cake into slices at a mechanical saw."
	quest.4295FFE533400262.title: "Slice of Wisdom"
	quest.4308EF3DF4032FBD.quest_subtitle: "Frogports can be used to automatically send packagers from a packager onto a chain conveyor to move items around"
	quest.430CAC90C8B34A17.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Delay to introduce a short pause before your spell continues its sequence."]
	quest.430CAC90C8B34A17.quest_subtitle: "Time your spells"
	quest.430CAC90C8B34A17.title: "Glyph: Delay"
	quest.4311A142FD7E1572.quest_desc: [
		"Summon or bind your first Familiar."
		""
		"Familiars can assist in combat, gathering, or utility depending on type and upgrades."
		"Treat them as magical partners, not just pets."
	]
	quest.4311A142FD7E1572.title: "A Mage Needs a Friend"
	quest.43784C83C8A76E8B.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Sunrise to shift the world’s time toward morning using ritual magic."]
	quest.43784C83C8A76E8B.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Ritual of Sunrise to call forth a new dawn on command."
	quest.43784C83C8A76E8B.title: "Ritual of Sunrise"
	quest.441C0659ED28D935.quest_desc: ["Unlock basic Ars Nouveau glyphs and gain access to foundational spell components."]
	quest.441C0659ED28D935.quest_subtitle: "First tier of glyphs"
	quest.441C0659ED28D935.title: "Basic Spell Glyphs"
	quest.44D5ABE34271D7FE.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Hex to apply negative status effects or curses to your targets."]
	quest.44D5ABE34271D7FE.quest_subtitle: "Curses and debuffs"
	quest.44D5ABE34271D7FE.title: "Glyph: Hex"
	quest.44D94BDCDFAB2D8E.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your Battlemage Armor to tier 3"
	quest.44D94BDCDFAB2D8E.title: "Battlemage T3"
	quest.4537E75529E86A95.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Extraction is the pinnacle of reclamation magic. Unlike its predecessors, it does not demand sacrifice of the item itself. When used, it extracts all of the enchantments from an item without destroying it, leaving the gear intact while transferring its full magical essence. Crafted by infusing the Tome of Superior Scrapping within the enchantment table, this tome represents mastery over preservation and recovery. It is a book of perfect balance—where destruction is no longer required, and every enchantment can be reclaimed in full."]
	quest.4537E75529E86A95.quest_subtitle: "A tome of preservation, reclaiming all the magic."
	quest.457DE8C154641437.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Ritual Brazier to begin performing powerful Ars Nouveau rituals."]
	quest.457DE8C154641437.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Ritual Brazier as the focal point for all your rites."
	quest.457DE8C154641437.title: "Ritual Brazier"
	quest.46020AEACD442BBE.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade to a Timer Spell Turret to fire spells at regular intervals."
	quest.46020AEACD442BBE.title: "Timer Spell Turret"
	quest.46469E3A8AF0CB80.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Extract to pull items or fluids out of blocks or inventories using magic."]
	quest.46469E3A8AF0CB80.quest_subtitle: "Pull resources out"
	quest.46469E3A8AF0CB80.title: "Glyph: Extract"
	quest.4697074A84101815.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Experience Hatch to hold XP fluid."
	quest.4697074A84101815.title: "XP Storage"
	quest.46B4B935285F1D95.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade XP blocks into Super XP Blocks by striking experience blocks with lightning"
	quest.46B4B935285F1D95.title: "Condensed Wisdom"
	quest.46E2AEA9B34CCA3A.quest_subtitle: "Capture the essence of life itself with Anima Essence."
	quest.46E2AEA9B34CCA3A.title: "Anima Essence"
	quest.477D7F2129D36D55.quest_desc: ["Inscribed upon Gem-Fused Slate, this sigil carries the rare power of release. When invoked upon the Smithing Table, it severs the bond between item and gem, drawing forth every socketed jewel without harm. The affixes remain untouched, yet the gems are freed to be used anew. Each sigil is a ritual of unbinding, a quiet reversal of fate that restores choice to the wielder and preserves the treasures once locked within."]
	quest.477D7F2129D36D55.quest_subtitle: "Freedom From The Forge."
	quest.481B8833F1280005.quest_desc: ["Crafted from echoshards and candles, the Echoing Deepshelf resonates with the whispers of the abyss. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 75.00) and a potent +15.00% Arcana, flooding the ritual with insight drawn from voices long forgotten. Its surface hums faintly, as though the deep itself is speaking through it, guiding the enchanter toward truths hidden in shadow. Yet its guidance is unsettling—each echo a reminder that the abyss does not give freely, but demands reverence for its secrets."]
	quest.481B8833F1280005.quest_subtitle: "Echo of deep, vision of chance."
	quest.485EE9E6C6F59826.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Gravity to manipulate gravitational forces on entities and blocks."]
	quest.485EE9E6C6F59826.quest_subtitle: "Control weight and pull"
	quest.485EE9E6C6F59826.title: "Glyph: Gravity"
	quest.4895F8C6E6ADB158.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Novice Spellbook."
		""
		"This is your personal spellcasting tool; it holds spell slots, organizes glyphs,"
		"and lets you actually cast."
		"Once crafted, open it and explore the built-in progression tabs."
	]
	quest.4895F8C6E6ADB158.title: "The First Spellbook"
	quest.48D5D9D9AD98409F.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Starbuncle Charm to gain access to an adorable helper that can move items and assist with automation."]
	quest.48D5D9D9AD98409F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Starbuncle Charm to enlist a tiny astral helper for item transport."
	quest.48D5D9D9AD98409F.title: "Starbuncle Steward"
	quest.490495066508001D.quest_subtitle: "Enemy drops are directly converted to experience."
	quest.490495066508001D.title: "Knowledge of the Ages"
	quest.4934E3529C6D1898.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Super Enchanting Template from Super XP Blocks."
	quest.4934E3529C6D1898.title: "Advanced Templates"
	quest.495990C8C95A955B.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Redstone Signal so your spells can emit redstone power where they land."]
	quest.495990C8C95A955B.quest_subtitle: "Magic meets redstone"
	quest.495990C8C95A955B.title: "Glyph: Redstone Signal"
	quest.496639EC3DC0165C.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Harvest to automatically harvest crops and plants using your spells."]
	quest.496639EC3DC0165C.quest_subtitle: "Farm with spells"
	quest.496639EC3DC0165C.title: "Glyph: Harvest"
	quest.49E931D566BB442C.quest_subtitle: "Right-click a tank of XP fluid with a bucket."
	quest.49E931D566BB442C.title: "Bottled Knowledge"
	quest.4A41FCBFE985D81E.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Glide to give yourself slow, controlled falling over long distances."]
	quest.4A41FCBFE985D81E.quest_subtitle: "Controlled descent"
	quest.4A41FCBFE985D81E.title: "Glyph: Glide"
	quest.4AC4974D0C691A5F.quest_subtitle: "22 days"
	quest.4AC4974D0C691A5F.title: "Luminary"
	quest.4B9968BAD0B3BFA6.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade Your Sorcerer Armor to Tier 3"
	quest.4B9968BAD0B3BFA6.title: "Sorcerer T3"
	quest.4BA8C442FA604DDA.quest_desc: ["Tomes are specialized books designed to hold only a single category of enchantments. Unlike ordinary enchanted books, which can accept a wide variety of enchantments, tomes are focused and precise. Each tome is bound to a specific type—such as weapon, armor, or tool—and will only accept enchantments that match its nature. This makes them invaluable for organizing and amplifying your enchanting process, ensuring that the right powers are stored exactly where they belong. By mastering tomes, you gain control over enchantment specialization, turning chaos into clarity and precision."]
	quest.4BA8C442FA604DDA.quest_subtitle: "Books that bind only one kind of enchant."
	quest.4BAF3B12E7D359A1.quest_subtitle: "Distill the power of wind into Air Essence for advanced recipes."
	quest.4BAF3B12E7D359A1.title: "Air Essence"
	quest.4C0F93AD6B3E40A0.quest_subtitle: "Craft the earth-aligned Ars Elemental armor set to embody stone and soil."
	quest.4C0F93AD6B3E40A0.title: "Earth Elemental Vestments"
	quest.4C7A66417B55FC70.quest_desc: ["Though born of humble craft, the Smithing Table has become a cornerstone of Apotheosis. Upon its surface, weapons, armor, and tools are laid bare, awaiting the touch of transformation. Feed it with the many Sigils—each carrying its own arcane purpose—and watch as your gear ascends, reforged and renewed. From simple upgrades to profound rebirths, the Smithing Table is the crucible where mortal steel meets divine power."]
	quest.4C7A66417B55FC70.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade Your Gear!"
	quest.4CAA535E684880F3.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Jump Ring to enhance your mobility with magical leaps."
	quest.4CAA535E684880F3.title: "Ring of Leaping"
	quest.4CAC87774C1B15C0.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Fell to cut down trees or large amounts of wood with a single spell."]
	quest.4CAC87774C1B15C0.quest_subtitle: "Lumberjack magic"
	quest.4CAC87774C1B15C0.title: "Glyph: Fell"
	quest.4D73D5A26E270AC4.quest_subtitle: "Distill summoning magic into Conjuration Essence for advanced spells."
	quest.4D73D5A26E270AC4.title: "Conjuration Essence"
	quest.4E0976E1DAF65FC9.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Burrowing to carve tunnels or clear areas underground with ritual power."]
	quest.4E0976E1DAF65FC9.quest_subtitle: "Let the earth part before you, carving tunnels with arcane precision."
	quest.4E0976E1DAF65FC9.title: "Ritual of Burrowing"
	quest.4ED6A6EEB38C2C32.title: "Shadow Radiance Helmet"
	quest.4EDEC672A893299E.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a Portable Energy Interface to move power to and from"
		"moving contraptions and other mobile machines."
	]
	quest.4EDEC672A893299E.quest_subtitle: "Portable Energy Interface"
	quest.4EDEC672A893299E.title: "Power on the Move"
	quest.4EFF440D65DAB644.quest_desc: ["Born of blaze and tempered with regeneration, the Hellshelf is one of the first steps into Apotheosis enchanting. It grants +3.00 Eterna (Max 45.00), while stirring +3.00% Quanta into the ritual. Though modest in strength, its balance of magical energy and chaos makes it a foundation for early enchantments. In time, the Hellshelf may be refined into superior variants, each carrying greater resonance, but even in its simplest form it embodies the fiery gamble of enchantment—energy gained, chaos invited."]
	quest.4EFF440D65DAB644.quest_subtitle: "Foundation of hell, spark of chance"
	quest.4F02D7406FFECD65.quest_subtitle: "You will mine very fast, but never instantly."
	quest.4F02D7406FFECD65.title: "Miner's Fervor"
	quest.4F8119B6298EA753.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Cloudshaping to manipulate the sky and cloud conditions above you."]
	quest.4F8119B6298EA753.quest_subtitle: "Manipulate the skies above, shifting clouds with your will."
	quest.4F8119B6298EA753.title: "Ritual of Cloudshaping"
	quest.4FB66A4A773F76A0.quest_desc: [
		"Press Biomass into Biomass Pellets – a strong solid fuel"
		"for furnaces and other generators."
	]
	quest.4FB66A4A773F76A0.quest_subtitle: "Biomass Pellets"
	quest.4FB66A4A773F76A0.title: "Compact Fuel"
	quest.5000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"The Scroll Forge crafts specific spell scrolls using paper, ink, and a focus item."
		"Build one so you can target the spells and schools you want to learn."
	]
	quest.5000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Craft your own scrolls"
	quest.5000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Scroll Forge"
	quest.510DD5B019050274.quest_desc: ["The trophies of slain creatures carry more than grim decoration—they channel chaos itself. When placed near the Enchantment Table, monster heads imbue the process with Quanta, the essence of pure randomness. Each ordinary monster head grants +5.00 Quanta, while the skull of a Wither Skeleton surges with greater force, granting +10.00. Quanta is pure chaos: it increases the underlying unpredictability of enchantments, scattering outcomes across a wider spectrum. Though this chaos can yield wonders, it may also bring ruin. Only Quantic Stability, drawn from shelves of stone and geode, can temper its wild effects. To mount a skull is to invite chance into the ritual—an embrace of fortune and folly alike."]
	quest.510DD5B019050274.quest_subtitle: "The skull that teaches Quanta’s truth."
	quest.5110534952F00751.quest_subtitle: "Bake an Experience Cake with XP fluid and cake base."
	quest.5110534952F00751.title: "Sweet Knowledge"
	quest.51162B9185A45BB1.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Spell Bow, a ranged weapon designed to integrate spellcasting into your arrows."]
	quest.51162B9185A45BB1.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Spell Bow to fire arrows infused with your spell patterns."
	quest.51162B9185A45BB1.title: "Spellbow"
	quest.511C3AC6DE62E2B9.quest_desc: [
		"Combine multiple glyphs into a single spell."
		""
		"For example:"
		"- Projectile + Harm + Amplify for extra damage"
		"- Touch + Break + Fortune for better mining"
		""
		"Your goal is to understand how glyph order and combinations change the result."
	]
	quest.511C3AC6DE62E2B9.title: "Layered Spells"
	quest.511E9B861BDB556D.quest_subtitle: "By creating a pool of lava with 10,000 blocks of lava in total you can create a bottomless supply, using a hose pully you can have access to an unlimited supply of lava"
	quest.511E9B861BDB556D.title: "Infinite Lava Source"
	quest.515001313775DCFC.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Cut to add a cutting effect that can harvest blocks or damage entities."]
	quest.515001313775DCFC.quest_subtitle: "Slice through blocks or foes"
	quest.515001313775DCFC.title: "Glyph: Cut"
	quest.5159FBC7DF556095.quest_subtitle: "Refine raw stone and soil into Earth Essence."
	quest.5159FBC7DF556095.title: "Earth Essence"
	quest.518A2A576E3C8B0D.quest_subtitle: "1 day"
	quest.518A2A576E3C8B0D.title: "Tinkerer"
	quest.51A8C0F89B9E9367.quest_desc: [
		"Integrate Ars Nouveau with other mods in your pack."
		""
		"Use Source, spells, or automation to:"
		"- Assist with resource generation"
		"- Improve farms"
		"- Enhance storage or transport systems"
		""
		"A good mage uses magic to make everything else easier."
	]
	quest.51A8C0F89B9E9367.title: "Synergy with Technology"
	quest.532780AFAD0B9187.quest_subtitle: "Integrate additional Cloudshaping braziers into your weather network."
	quest.532780AFAD0B9187.title: "Ritual of Cloudshaping (Array)"
	quest.542C6D76B579886C.quest_desc: ["Obtain Magebloom Fiber, a refined material crafted from Magebloom crops used in many Ars Nouveau recipes."]
	quest.542C6D76B579886C.quest_subtitle: "Refine magebloom into fiber, a key component for magical garments."
	quest.542C6D76B579886C.title: "Spinning Magebloom"
	quest.54BE4690A184F764.quest_subtitle: "Negates the mining speed penatly for flying."
	quest.54BE4690A184F764.title: "Stable Footing"
	quest.562769F1AFDFC3CB.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Aqua set to channel the power and flow of water."
	quest.562769F1AFDFC3CB.title: "Aqua Elemental Vestments"
	quest.566914F5FF23B511.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Chestplates is bound exclusively to the enchantments of torso armor. It accepts only magics that fortify the body—whether granting resilience, elemental resistance, or protective wards. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their chestplate becomes a bastion of strength, shielding the heart and core against the fiercest blows. It is a tome of endurance, a record of enchantments meant to guard the bearer’s lifeblood."]
	quest.566914F5FF23B511.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the heart."
	quest.56C941E7CEC41FE1.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Chipped Gems!"
	quest.56C941E7CEC41FE1.title: "Chipped Gems!"
	quest.5766C8B9E850C186.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Imbuement Chamber to infuse mundane items with magical properties."]
	quest.5766C8B9E850C186.quest_subtitle: "Construct an Imbuement Chamber to transform mundane items into magical tools."
	quest.5766C8B9E850C186.title: "Imbuement Chamber"
	quest.57A3ED85BB61157E.quest_desc: [
		"Ender spells use Ender Pearls as their focus, bending space and teleportation."
		"Defeat an Enderman and secure a pearl for spatial magic."
	]
	quest.57A3ED85BB61157E.title: "Ender Focus – Ender Pearl"
	quest.57CF76650A07568D.quest_subtitle: "Slows attackers."
	quest.57CF76650A07568D.title: "Icy Thorn's"
	quest.5835563F96EEF71F.quest_desc: [
		"Not every spell has to blow things up."
		""
		"Unlock a utility glyph that helps with everyday tasks,"
		"such as Light, Blink, Grow, Harvest, or Regenerate."
	]
	quest.5835563F96EEF71F.title: "Utility over Destruction"
	quest.58729C9840C1D586.quest_desc: ["Buzzing with unruly resonance, the Beeshelf is a shelf of sacrifice. It grants -30.00 Eterna and +100.00% Quanta, stripping away magical energy while flooding the ritual with pure chaos. To place this shelf is to trade stability for unpredictability, inviting enchantments to scatter wildly across fortune and folly. Where other shelves refine or balance, the Beeshelf revels in disorder, turning the ritual into a gamble. It is not a shelf of power, but of chance—lowering energy to summon chaos in abundance."]
	quest.58729C9840C1D586.quest_subtitle: "The shelf that trades power for chance."
	quest.58BF5AAA3DE5F16F.quest_subtitle: "6 days"
	quest.58BF5AAA3DE5F16F.title: "Inventor"
	quest.58EBEC3DDE47DAC7.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Ignite to add simple fire-starting power to your spells."]
	quest.58EBEC3DDE47DAC7.quest_subtitle: "A spark of fire"
	quest.58EBEC3DDE47DAC7.title: "Glyph: Ignite"
	quest.58EC47584C773B82.quest_desc: ["Obtain Magebloom Crops to begin farming an essential magical plant for Ars Nouveau cloth and components."]
	quest.58EC47584C773B82.quest_subtitle: "Grow Magebloom crops to secure a steady source of magical fiber."
	quest.58EC47584C773B82.title: "Planting Magebloom"
	quest.59322E728F393D2C.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Flawless Gems!"
	quest.59322E728F393D2C.title: "Flawless Gems!"
	quest.599E5890842A99C5.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade your spellbook to a higher tier, such as Apprentice or Archmage."
		""
		"Higher tiers give more spell slots, better capacity, and access to stronger glyphs."
	]
	quest.599E5890842A99C5.title: "Greater Spellbook"
	quest.59BD06DB42E0219F.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Evaporate to remove or dry up water and other fluids using magic."]
	quest.59BD06DB42E0219F.quest_subtitle: "Remove liquids"
	quest.59BD06DB42E0219F.title: "Glyph: Evaporate"
	quest.59D2A38476E664A7.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Ring of Lesser Discount to reduce the mana cost of your spells."
	quest.59D2A38476E664A7.title: "Lesser Discount Ring"
	quest.5A63BB8008497AE4.quest_desc: [
		"Blood spells draw power from Blood Vials produced in a cauldron."
		"Obtain a vial of blood to fuel darker, life-draining magic."
	]
	quest.5A63BB8008497AE4.title: "Blood Focus – Blood Vial"
	quest.5AD83D16B2A5C2AB.quest_desc: [
		"Craft Small Connectors to begin moving energy between"
		"machines using your new wires and spools."
	]
	quest.5AD83D16B2A5C2AB.title: "Small Connectors"
	quest.5B0FA59317E872BC.quest_desc: [
		"You have reached the pinnacle of Ars Nouveau."
		""
		"By now, you should have:"
		"- A high-tier spellbook"
		"- Several well-designed spells (utility, combat, mobility)"
		"- A familiar with upgrades"
		"- Automated Source production and routing"
		""
		"Consider your signature spell and favorite automation."
		"You’ve become a true practitioner of Ars Nouveau."
	]
	quest.5B0FA59317E872BC.title: "Master of the Ars"
	quest.5B4832F02C359AED.quest_desc: ["Forged from ender pearls and the severed head of the Ender Dragon, the Draconic Endshelf is the apex of enchanting power. It grants a staggering +20.00 Eterna (Max 100.00), eclipsing all other shelves in Apotheosis. Its surface hums with the resonance of eternity, each carved scale and pearl binding enchantments to the dragon’s eternal flame. To craft it is to claim dominion over the void itself—a shelf that embodies finality, silence, and the unyielding might of the End."]
	quest.5B4832F02C359AED.quest_subtitle: "Dominion of end, eternity of chance."
	quest.5B84D47C6F6F851E.quest_desc: ["The Tome of the Archers is bound exclusively to the enchantments of bows. It accepts only magics that empower ranged combat—whether granting precision, power, swiftness, or durability. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their bow becomes a weapon of focused mastery, turning every arrow into a strike of purpose. It is a tome of distance and discipline, a record of enchantments meant to guide the archer’s aim across the battlefield."]
	quest.5B84D47C6F6F851E.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the bow."
	quest.5BB155110168DF92.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Freeze to turn water to ice or freeze your enemies in place."]
	quest.5BB155110168DF92.quest_subtitle: "Turn water and foes to ice"
	quest.5BB155110168DF92.title: "Glyph: Freeze"
	quest.5BED6E38553F17BC.quest_subtitle: "Empowers damage dealt by shields."
	quest.5BED6E38553F17BC.title: "Shield Bash"
	quest.5BFFECD73BC1743D.quest_desc: [
		"You have reached the pinnacle of Ars Nouveau."
		""
		"By now, you should have:"
		"- A high-tier spellbook"
		"- Several well-designed spells (utility, combat, mobility)"
		"- A familiar with upgrades"
		"- Automated Source production and routing"
		""
		"Consider your signature spell and favorite automation."
		"You’ve become a true practitioner of Ars Nouveau."
	]
	quest.5BFFECD73BC1743D.title: "Master of the Ars"
	quest.5C28F7A1F25636AB.quest_desc: [
		"Evocation spells use Emeralds as their focus, calling forth summoned power."
		"Obtain an emerald to act as the heart of your conjured magic."
	]
	quest.5C28F7A1F25636AB.title: "Evocation Focus – Emerald"
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.quest_desc: ["Obtain Sourcestone, a simple building material infused with Source that anchors your early setups."]
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.quest_subtitle: "Craft Sourcestone blocks to build infrastructure for your magical base."
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.5C4917F9572E763C.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock or craft at least one upgrade or ability for your familiar."
		""
		"Try to specialize them:"
