	quest.5C4917F9572E763C.title: "Empowering your Familiar"
	quest.5C7861E033CCA05A.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Flawed Gems!"
	quest.5C7861E033CCA05A.title: "Flawed Gems"
	quest.5C7D4C5CDE1EF3B0.quest_desc: [
		"Add a Redstone Relay to gate your energy flow."
		"Automate when entire sections of the grid turn on or off."
	]
	quest.5C7D4C5CDE1EF3B0.quest_subtitle: "Redstone Relay"
	quest.5C7D4C5CDE1EF3B0.title: "Redstone-Controlled Power"
	quest.5CAE165DABB2A5D2.quest_subtitle: "Collect all the Cracked Gems!"
	quest.5CAE165DABB2A5D2.title: "Cracked Gems"
	quest.5CFBA24B3E0CDEDD.quest_desc: ["To begin your journey into spellcraft, you must first create a Basic Spell Parchment. This simple yet essential component serves as the foundational medium for inscribing your spells. Gather the required materials and craft one yourself — only then can you channel your magic into written form."]
	quest.5CFBA24B3E0CDEDD.quest_subtitle: "Craft Spell Parchment, the base ingredient for reusable spell scrolls."
	quest.5CFBA24B3E0CDEDD.title: "Spell Parchment"
	quest.5D09BFEE2F039CFD.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock at least one new Form glyph, such as AoE."
		""
		"Experiment by swapping your new Form into your existing spells."
		"Changing only the form can make a spell feel completely different."
	]
	quest.5D09BFEE2F039CFD.title: "New Forms, New Possibilities"
	quest.5D2CCE8038A39D5E.quest_subtitle: "8 days"
	quest.5D2CCE8038A39D5E.title: "Architect"
	quest.5DE36D1C9F29F931.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Explosion to add explosive force to your offensive spells. Use with care!"]
	quest.5DE36D1C9F29F931.quest_subtitle: "Boom"
	quest.5DE36D1C9F29F931.title: "Glyph: Explosion"
	quest.5ED9EBFCF0FBA9F5.quest_desc: [
		"As you unlock more glyphs, your spellbook can get messy."
		""
		"Organize your spells:"
		"- Keep one for utility, one for combat, one for mobility, etc."
		"Rename and rearrange them so you can quickly swap during combat or exploration."
	]
	quest.5ED9EBFCF0FBA9F5.title: "Managing Spell Slots"
	quest.5F53BD18C3D7339F.quest_desc: [
		"Spells don’t run on hope alone – you need Source."
		"Obtain a Source Gem, the basic refined form of Source."
		""
		"Source is the magical fuel for Ars Nouveau: you’ll use it for crafting, automation, and enchanting."
	]
	quest.5F53BD18C3D7339F.title: "Source of Power"
	quest.5F75215CB5956290.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Accelerate to increase the speed of entities, blocks, or processes affected by your spells."]
	quest.5F75215CB5956290.quest_subtitle: "Speed things up"
	quest.5F75215CB5956290.title: "Glyph: Accelerate"
	quest.5F7A07D0F71044D2.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Duration Down to reduce how long certain spell effects persist in the world."]
	quest.5F7A07D0F71044D2.quest_subtitle: "Shorten spell effects"
	quest.5F7A07D0F71044D2.title: "Glyph: Duration Down"
	quest.5F8F4C5E73A674C8.quest_desc: ["Carved from prismarine and left hollow, this shelf does not lend strength to the Enchantment Table. Instead, it filters the flow of magic, concealing any enchanted book placed within from the table’s sight. By storing volumes here, their enchantments remain hidden, unseen in the pool of available choices. In this way, the Seashelf serves as a quiet separator—removing clutter, refining options, and ensuring only the desired magics rise to the surface."]
	quest.5F8F4C5E73A674C8.quest_subtitle: "Filtering magic, hiding its trace."
	quest.5FBB5D0C960D3C68.quest_desc: [
		"Scale up your power lines with Large Connectors."
		"These help distribute energy to bigger systems."
	]
	quest.5FBB5D0C960D3C68.title: "Large Connectors"
	quest.5FDA2E1F3E5717B5.quest_subtitle: "Craft Arcanist armor, blending survivability and spellcasting."
	quest.5FDA2E1F3E5717B5.title: "Arcanist’s Regalia"
	quest.6000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"The Alchemist's Cauldron brews inks, elixirs, and other magical reagents."
		"Craft one to unlock more advanced spell components and upgrades."
	]
	quest.6000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Brew inks and elixirs"
	quest.6000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Alchemist's Cauldron"
	quest.6055B1011DC51F4D.quest_subtitle: "Sheared wool will be changed to a random color."
	quest.6055B1011DC51F4D.title: "Chromatic aberration"
	quest.608711260A29AD72.quest_desc: [
		"Summon or bind your first Familiar."
		""
		"Familiars can assist in combat, gathering, or utility depending on type and upgrades."
		"Treat them as magical partners, not just pets."
	]
	quest.608711260A29AD72.title: "A Mage Needs a Friend"
	quest.615056F493364999.quest_desc: ["Crafted from an infused dragon’s breath and an ender pearl, the Endshelf hums with the resonance of the void. It grants +5.00 Eterna (Max 90.00), +5.00% Quanta, and +5.00% Arcana, binding enchantments to the infinite horizon where time and space unravel. Its surface shimmers faintly, as though reflecting the endless skies of the End. To wield it is to touch the silence of eternity, a shelf that guides with alien precision while reminding the enchanter that the void is never truly empty."]
	quest.615056F493364999.quest_subtitle: "Foundation of end, silence of chance."
	quest.61971A203C6E7D6A.quest_desc: ["Forged in shadow and tempered by the fires of the Nether, this template allows found gear—bearing affixes and augments—to be reborn in netherite. Place your weapon, armor, or tool upon the Smithing Table, align it with the Netherite Template, and watch as abyssal flame consumes it. The item’s powers remain intact, yet its form ascends into netherite’s indomitable strength. What was once treasure now becomes an eternal relic, unyielding to time and flame, a testament to power drawn from the depths."]
	quest.61971A203C6E7D6A.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading To Netherite!"
	quest.61BA9A172C727816.quest_subtitle: "Use the Printer to duplicate a high-level enchantment."
	quest.61BA9A172C727816.title: "Masterpiece Copy"
	quest.62708E9F7887453A.quest_desc: ["Summit is the threshold of greatness, the tier where rare mastery is tested against the Wither itself. To unlock it, you must equip a full Rare set of armor and weapon, and slay the Wither, proving your strength against one of the world’s most destructive forces. Within Summit, rare and epic enchantments dominate, mythic power flickers into reach, and gems gleam with higher purity—normal shards abound, with flawless and perfect fragments appearing in rare glimmers. Adventurers gain +75% experience and +50% luck, yet monsters rise as juggernauts, bearing +12 armor, +10 armor toughness, +15 armor pierce, and +10 protection pierce. Summit is the high place of trial, the final ascent before the Pinnacle itself."]
	quest.62708E9F7887453A.quest_subtitle: "The high tier, where trials peak."
	quest.62A9FD6138446A17.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Dampen to reduce or soften the power of certain spell effects as needed."]
	quest.62A9FD6138446A17.quest_subtitle: "Weaken magical effects"
	quest.62A9FD6138446A17.title: "Glyph: Dampen"
	quest.62C3207FB3716CC2.quest_desc: [
		"Process crops, leaves, or other plant matter into Biomass"
		"using Create’s mixing and Seed Oil."
	]
	quest.62C3207FB3716CC2.quest_subtitle: "Biomass"
	quest.62C3207FB3716CC2.title: "Green Energy"
	quest.62D90D4A5EF127F1.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade your spellbook to a higher tier, such as Apprentice or Archmage."
		""
		"Higher tiers give more spell slots, better capacity, and access to stronger glyphs."
	]
	quest.62D90D4A5EF127F1.title: "Greater Spellbook"
	quest.6302F31EA460CE0C.quest_subtitle: "Document a second Warping ritual node in your network."
	quest.6302F31EA460CE0C.title: "Ritual of Warping (Array)"
	quest.632BC46928CC9A8C.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Enchanter's Mirror, an item for reflecting or interacting with magic in unique ways."]
	quest.632BC46928CC9A8C.quest_subtitle: "Use the Enchanter’s Mirror to reflect and redirect magical effects."
	quest.632BC46928CC9A8C.title: "Enchanter’s Mirror"
	quest.633BD964DE443C95.quest_desc: ["Your journey begins with the hunt for an Apotheosis gem. Cast it to the earth, and let the weight of an anvil shatter it into fragments. From the wreckage, dust will rise—humble yet powerful. This dust is not just debris… it is the spark, the very first step of your grand adventure."]
	quest.633BD964DE443C95.quest_subtitle: "Your journey begins!"
	quest.633BD964DE443C95.title: "The Beginning!"
	quest.634B477861AC9162.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Ritual: Binding to bind entities or items together through ritual magic."]
	quest.634B477861AC9162.quest_subtitle: "Bind entities in place or to specific locations using this ritual."
	quest.634B477861AC9162.title: "Ritual of Binding"
	quest.636B4F0F194DEF80.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Superior Scrapping is a book of total reclamation. Unlike its lesser counterpart, it does not settle for fragments—it extracts all of the enchantments from an item, consuming the item entirely in the process. Crafted by infusing the Tome of Scrapping within the enchantment table, this tome represents a higher mastery of sacrifice, ensuring that no magic is wasted. Though the item is destroyed, its full enchantment essence is preserved, granting adventurers the ability to salvage complete power from gear that has reached its end."]
	quest.636B4F0F194DEF80.quest_subtitle: "A tome of sacrifice, reclaiming all the magic."
	quest.63DD7F5A4441ACE7.quest_desc: ["Complete your scribes' table setup to begin unlocking more advanced spell glyph quests."]
	quest.63DD7F5A4441ACE7.quest_subtitle: "Unlock stronger glyph recipes"
	quest.63DD7F5A4441ACE7.title: "Advanced Spell Glyphs"
	quest.654BBA892194CE78.quest_subtitle: "Trees will be annihilated."
	quest.654BBA892194CE78.title: "Chainsaw"
	quest.6555B5DB0DD9CB42.quest_desc: [
		"Fire spells use Blaze Rods as their magical focus in the Scroll Forge."
		"Hunt down a Blaze and secure a rod to channel destructive flames."
	]
	quest.6555B5DB0DD9CB42.title: "Fire Focus – Blaze Rod"
	quest.669A1AA162D4A685.quest_subtitle: "Learn to combine reagents and Source to create magical Essences."
	quest.669A1AA162D4A685.title: "Essence Crafting"
	quest.669A2EB20502008A.quest_desc: ["The simplest shelf, built of wood and ink, it is the first step in channeling enchantments. Though modest in power, these shelves feed the Enchantment Table with whispers of knowledge, allowing magic to take root. Yet their strength is fleeting—soon they will be decommissioned, replaced by greater shelves of arcane design. Still, every library begins here, with plain wood and the promise of more."]
	quest.669A2EB20502008A.quest_subtitle: "A humble beginning to arcane study."
	quest.66D63DC37FCDD268.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Fortune to apply fortune-like effects to block drops when using spells."]
	quest.66D63DC37FCDD268.quest_subtitle: "Lucky mining"
	quest.66D63DC37FCDD268.title: "Glyph: Fortune"
	quest.6799EAE4447A379E.quest_desc: [
		"Spells don’t run on hope alone – you need Source."
		"Set up some early Source infrastructure, like a Source Jar and Sourcegem."
		""
		"Source is the magical fuel for Ars Nouveau: you’ll use it for crafting, automation, and enchanting."
	]
	quest.6799EAE4447A379E.title: "Source of Power"
	quest.67A207CF6900F232.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Snare to add slowing or immobilizing effects to your spell setups."]
	quest.67A207CF6900F232.quest_subtitle: "Hold your enemies in place"
	quest.67A207CF6900F232.title: "Glyph: Snare"
	quest.67D6DB96BDC75B4E.quest_desc: ["A fragment of ancient power, etched with runes that whisper of renewal. When placed upon the reforging table, the sigil awakens dormant energies, consuming dust and rarity materials to breathe new life into weapons, armor, and tools. Each use is a ritual of transformation—items are reborn, their affixes and augments shifting as if rewritten by fate itself. Though fragile in form, the sigil’s magic is enduring, a promise that even the most worn relic may rise again."]
	quest.67D6DB96BDC75B4E.quest_subtitle: "Fuel The Reforge Table!"
	quest.68C88311E9090287.quest_desc: [
		"Refine Arcane Essence into Arcane Ingots for use in stronger gear and tools."
		"These ingots are the metal backbone of magical equipment."
	]
	quest.68C88311E9090287.quest_subtitle: "Smelt your essence"
	quest.68C88311E9090287.title: "Arcane Ingots"
	quest.68DC7AA63D5AC59C.title: "Shadow Radiance Boots"
	quest.69A04EB462756EED.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Underfoot to apply spell effects centered around your immediate position."]
	quest.69A04EB462756EED.quest_subtitle: "Effects beneath you"
	quest.69A04EB462756EED.title: "Glyph: Underfoot"
	quest.69B3837E5224E0F5.quest_subtitle: "Packagers can be used to remove items from a storage upon being requested by the stock keeper or factory gauge"
	quest.6A3FAFC38ED9DCF6.quest_desc: ["Forged with greater precision in the fires of the Nether, this shelf does not empower the Enchantment Table’s strength, but instead sharpens vision beyond the ordinary. Unlike its lesser counterpart, a single Hellshelf of Masterful Sight reveals two enchantment clues at once, allowing the reader to pierce deeper into the hidden weave of magic. Its effect is stackable—each shelf doubling the insight granted, until the full tapestry of enchantments is laid bare. Though it offers no power to the books themselves, its mastery lies in sight: unveiling secrets that others would miss."]
	quest.6A3FAFC38ED9DCF6.quest_subtitle: "Twice the insight, one shelf."
	quest.6A8CD72A477685BD.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock or craft at least one upgrade or ability for your familiar."
		""
		"Try to specialize them:"
		"- Defensive bodyguard"
		"- Aggressive attacker"
		"- Utility assistant"
		""
		"Experiment and see which role fits your playstyle."
	]
	quest.6A8CD72A477685BD.title: "Empowering your Familiar"
	quest.6ABF5CF360AE7431.quest_desc: ["Formed from crystal sealed in stone, this shelf hums with steady resonance. It grants +10.00 Eterna (up to 60.00), while reducing Quanta by -15.00%. Yet its true gift is Quantic Stability—a rare property that negates the harmful side of Quanta’s chaos. Where monster heads and other relics invite randomness, the geode’s calm suppresses misfortune, ensuring that chaos bends toward balance. To build with these shelves is to weave certainty into the enchantment ritual, anchoring wild magic in crystalline order."]
	quest.6ABF5CF360AE7431.quest_subtitle: "The shelf that steadies pure chaos."
	quest.6B09426F81E507AB.quest_desc: ["Crystals grown in the deep earth hum with Eterna, the essence of magical energy. Eterna sets the maximum enchanting level, lifting the cap beyond thirty and allowing enchantments of greater strength to be revealed. Each Amethyst Cluster grants +1.00 Eterna, up to a maximum of 40.00, while also imposing -1.00% Quanta. To reach the full potential of forty, forty clusters must be placed—but the path is not limited to crystals alone. Shelves of many kinds may be mixed and matched, each contributing their own balance of Eterna, Quanta, and Arcana. Yet the highest max Eterna among your shelves sets the ceiling: no matter the blend, the strongest shelf defines how far your enchanting power may rise. In this way, Amethyst Clusters are stepping stones toward mastery, their glow a promise of magic beyond the ordinary."]
	quest.6B09426F81E507AB.quest_subtitle: "Crystals that teach Eterna’s truth."
	quest.6BCE2B29B2C5212C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Novice Spell Book—perfect for backup builds or extra spell sets."
	quest.6BCE2B29B2C5212C.title: "Novice Tome"
	quest.6C15C0C8E9DF4696.quest_subtitle: "27 days"
	quest.6C15C0C8E9DF4696.title: "Trailblazer"
	quest.6C3A756B93271078.quest_subtitle: "Using a stock link we can read the storage of inventories attached to a packager"
	quest.6C4E72C0BF98E8DD.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Rune to allow your spells to place temporary magical runes in the world."]
	quest.6C4E72C0BF98E8DD.quest_subtitle: "Place a magical marker"
	quest.6C4E72C0BF98E8DD.title: "Glyph: Rune"
	quest.6CDEBC3FFF96C321.quest_subtitle: "Duplicate your Burrowing ritual for broader mining operations."
	quest.6CDEBC3FFF96C321.title: "Ritual of Burrowing (Array)"
	quest.6CEAA86EEAAC1203.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Amethyst Golem Charm to summon a tough crystalline guardian for defense."]
	quest.6CEAA86EEAAC1203.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Amethyst Golem Charm to gain a sturdy crystalline protector."
	quest.6CEAA86EEAAC1203.title: "Amethyst Golem Guardian"
	quest.6D75A489480771E2.quest_subtitle: "Craft Sorcerer armor focused on spellcasting and mana efficiency."
	quest.6D75A489480771E2.title: "Sorcerer’s Garb"
	quest.6D87D5E7CBE5E4C2.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Rolling Mill on Bamboo or Paper to make Straw."
		"Straw unlocks liquid fuel support for Blaze Burners."
	]
	quest.6D87D5E7CBE5E4C2.title: "Roll a Straw"
	quest.6D8C9D7D9DF9A6DD.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Challenge to summon foes or encounters to test your combat ability."]
	quest.6D8C9D7D9DF9A6DD.quest_subtitle: "Summon foes to test your strength and earn magical rewards."
	quest.6D8C9D7D9DF9A6DD.title: "Ritual of Challenge"
	quest.6E0C9E003F20B341.quest_desc: [
		"Experiment with automated casting tools, such as Spell Turrets or Spell Projectors (depending on version)."
		""
		"Set up a simple automation:"
		"for example, an automated mining spell or a turret that protects an area."
	]
	quest.6E0C9E003F20B341.title: "Runes & Automation"
	quest.6E0E13806F388D7E.quest_desc: ["Acquire a simple book and turn it into your worn notebook to start learning Ars Nouveau."]
	quest.6E0E13806F388D7E.quest_subtitle: "Find the tattered notebook that begins your journey into Ars Nouveau."
	quest.6E0E13806F388D7E.title: "A Worn Notebook"
	quest.6E4AECDEB335861F.quest_subtitle: "Consumes recived healing to repair items."
	quest.6E4AECDEB335861F.title: "Life Mending"
	quest.6EEBE73455E4BE62.quest_subtitle: "Used to house a Robo Bee that will send items to you after requesting the item from the portable stock ticker"
	quest.6F2215F6DBCFCC24.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Scrapping is a book of sacrifice. When used, it extracts half of the enchantments from an item, destroying the item in the process. The enchantments recovered are chosen at random—you cannot decide which remain. Crafted in a crafting table with an anvil surrounded by books, it serves as a tool of reclamation, salvaging fragments of magic from gear that has reached its end. Through destruction comes renewal, ensuring that even broken arms and armor can yield echoes of their former power."]
	quest.6F2215F6DBCFCC24.quest_subtitle: "A tome of sacrifice, reclaiming half the magic."
	quest.6F3602F5600A6221.quest_desc: ["Progress your research to unlock the most powerful and complex glyphs in Ars Nouveau."]
	quest.6F3602F5600A6221.quest_subtitle: "High-tier magic components"
	quest.6F3602F5600A6221.title: "Master Spell Glyphs"
	quest.6FF047198D914434.quest_desc: [
		"As you unlock more glyphs, your spellbook can get messy."
		""
		"Organize your spells:"
		"- Keep one for utility, one for combat, one for mobility, etc."
		"Rename and rearrange them so you can quickly swap during combat or exploration."
	]
	quest.6FF047198D914434.title: "Managing Spell Slots"
	quest.7000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"The Arcane Anvil upgrades spell books, combines scrolls, and empowers weapons."
		"Set one up near your forge so you can improve your magical gear."
	]
	quest.7000A1B2C3D4E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your gear"
	quest.7000A1B2C3D4E5F6.title: "Arcane Anvil"
	quest.7022449BF35A4B2D.quest_subtitle: "Melee attackers may find themselves further away."
	quest.7022449BF35A4B2D.title: "Rebounding"
	quest.7051B75EDB94D5F6.quest_desc: [
		"Magic starts with a book."
		"Obtain the Worn Notebook from Ars Nouveau."
		""
		"This ancient journal is filled with half-faded notes, recipes, and strange glyphs."
		"Use it as your in-game guide for spells, machines, and more."
	]
	quest.7051B75EDB94D5F6.title: "A Curious Tome"
	quest.71722F244F58D669.quest_subtitle: "13 days"
	quest.71722F244F58D669.title: "Visionary"
	quest.72928D8717F6D44D.quest_desc: ["Accent deepens into true peril. To unlock it, you must don a full Uncommon set of armor and weapon, and prove your strength by slaying an Apothic Invader. Here, rare enchantments surge to dominance, epic power begins to surface, and mythic potential still lies beyond reach. Gems gleam brighter—flawed and normal purities abound, with flawless shards appearing in rare glimmers. The world itself shifts further: adventurers gain +55% experience and +30% luck, while monsters grow formidable with +8 armor and +5 armor pierce, cutting through defenses with ruthless precision. Accent is no longer a proving ground—it is a crucible, where survival demands mastery and courage."]
	quest.72928D8717F6D44D.quest_subtitle: "The third tier, where invaders fall"
	quest.7292A449EA16ECA3.quest_desc: ["Inscribed with runes of power, these sigils are the lifeblood of the Augmenting Table. When offered in the ritual, they awaken the table’s magic, allowing augments to be rerolled or elevated to greater strength. Each sigil carries the essence of growth and refinement, binding your hard-earned levels to the forge’s will. Without them, the path of augmentation lies dormant—but with them, your items may ascend toward their true potential."]
	quest.7292A449EA16ECA3.quest_subtitle: "Fuel The Augment Table!"
	quest.72D3552A5CF65E94.quest_desc: [
		"Casting spells uses Mana, a personal resource that regenerates over time."
		""
		"Experiment with your new spell until you learn how quickly your mana drains and refills."
		"Try not to spam spells pointlessly – smart casting is part of a good mage’s discipline."
	]
	quest.72D3552A5CF65E94.title: "Mana and You"
	quest.72E8C70AE9F7622A.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Enchanting Apparatus to craft something meaningful to your progression:"
		"perhaps a new glyph, a ring, or another utility item."
		""
		"Watch how Source is consumed during the crafting – you’ll be doing this often."
	]
	quest.72E8C70AE9F7622A.title: "A Ritual of Crafting"
	quest.73C7A44F05AB6FAC.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Orbit to create projectiles or effects that circle around you or a target."]
	quest.73C7A44F05AB6FAC.quest_subtitle: "Circling projectiles"
	quest.73C7A44F05AB6FAC.title: "Glyph: Orbit"
	quest.73C8EB5BB682575E.quest_subtitle: "3 days"
	quest.73C8EB5BB682575E.title: "Artisan"
	quest.73C9BE065B1F094B.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Light to place small magical lights wherever your spell lands."]
	quest.73C9BE065B1F094B.quest_subtitle: "Create magical illumination"
	quest.73C9BE065B1F094B.title: "Glyph: Light"
	quest.73D19C0C1836CD03.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Crush to add crushing physical damage or block-breaking power to your spells."]
	quest.73D19C0C1836CD03.quest_subtitle: "Apply heavy force"
	quest.73D19C0C1836CD03.title: "Glyph: Crush"
	quest.73FFE04D9F726353.title: "Pressing Sheets"
	quest.7471CDF5166D38F0.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Ritual: Flight to grant flight to players within its area of effect."]
	quest.7471CDF5166D38F0.quest_subtitle: "Lift yourself into the air with a ritual dedicated to aerial freedom."
	quest.7471CDF5166D38F0.title: "Ritual of Flight"
	quest.754D789B84FF9CB6.quest_desc: ["Place your weapon, armor, or tool upon this sacred table. Empower it with Sigils of Rebirth, and offer a material of the tier you desire. As the forge stirs, arcane fire engulfs your item, reshaping it into a new form—reborn with affixes and augments unseen before. This is no mere workbench, but the Enchantment Table of Affixes and Augments. Should fate deny you the outcome you seek, the ritual may be attempted again. And unlike its lesser kin, this reforge reaches even into the mythic tier."]
	quest.754D789B84FF9CB6.quest_subtitle: "Forging Into Mythic!"
	quest.75AD17D4601C7E4A.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Spell Turret for more flexible automated spellcasting."
	quest.75AD17D4601C7E4A.title: "Advanced Spell Turret"
	quest.76448BE19847747C.title: "Shadow Radiance Chestplate"
	quest.76F19EC63598DC65.quest_subtitle: "Using factory gauges we can monitor items in our logistics network, set a minimum amount, and automate the crafting of said items"
	quest.77145113CD5B26FB.quest_desc: ["Acquire a Mycelial Sourcelink to generate Source using mushrooms and fungal growth."]
	quest.77145113CD5B26FB.quest_subtitle: "Turn mushrooms and rot into magical energy with fungal efficiency."
	quest.77145113CD5B26FB.title: "Mycelial Sourcelink"
	quest.773583FF2E1E5B0D.quest_desc: [
		"Design a proper Ars Nouveau workshop."
		""
		"It should include:"
		"- Source generation and storage"
		"- An Imbuement Chamber"
		"- Enchanting Apparatus with pedestals"
		"- Source routing via relays and jars"
		""
		"This will be your main magical hub for all future projects."
	]
	quest.773583FF2E1E5B0D.title: "A Mage’s Workshop"
	quest.777AB100725CAEAA.quest_desc: ["The Augmenting Table is a chamber of renewal, where power is reshaped and refined. Cast your weapon, armor, or tool upon its surface, and fuel the ritual with Sigils of Enhancement. Offer your own hard-earned levels as tribute, and the table will stir with arcane force. Within its glow, augments may be rerolled into new forms, or existing augments elevated to greater strength. Each attempt bends fate itself, forging your path anew."]
	quest.777AB100725CAEAA.quest_subtitle: "Get Your Augments Here!"
	quest.779C2162C69DAE8E.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Summon Wolves to conjure loyal wolf companions for combat or protection."]
	quest.779C2162C69DAE8E.quest_subtitle: "Pack of companions"
	quest.779C2162C69DAE8E.title: "Glyph: Summon Wolves"
	quest.7862778F8424419B.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Launch to propel entities upwards or away with your spells."]
	quest.7862778F8424419B.quest_subtitle: "Send targets flying"
	quest.7862778F8424419B.title: "Glyph: Launch"
	quest.7878AB9D780D097B.quest_subtitle: "Mobs killed may roll their loot tables twice."
	quest.7878AB9D780D097B.title: "Scavanger"
	quest.78CA878F7CC4452D.quest_desc: [
		"Design a proper Ars Nouveau workshop."
		""
		"It should include:"
		"- Source generation and storage"
		"- An Imbuement Chamber"
		"- Enchanting Apparatus with pedestals"
		"- Source routing via relays and jars"
		""
		"This will be your main magical hub for all future projects."
	]
	quest.78CA878F7CC4452D.title: "A Mage’s Workshop"
	quest.790C77898FED4E5D.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Wind Shear to slice through enemies using blades of compressed air."]
	quest.790C77898FED4E5D.quest_subtitle: "Cut with air"
	quest.790C77898FED4E5D.title: "Glyph: Wind Shear"
	quest.79146466E43A2B99.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Flare to create a brief, bright burst of magical force for your spell combinations."]
	quest.79146466E43A2B99.quest_subtitle: "Short burst of magic"
	quest.79146466E43A2B99.title: "Glyph: Flare"
	quest.791F8B910E47D824.quest_subtitle: "Brew the burning heart of flame into Fire Essence."
	quest.791F8B910E47D824.title: "Fire Essence"
	quest.7A1899D10EF31DB0.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Rolling Mill to press plates into Copper Wire."
		"These will be the basic conductors for your early machines."
	]
	quest.7A1899D10EF31DB0.title: "Soft Conductors"
	quest.7A4EE0566101DAA8.quest_subtitle: "Refine the energy of protection and wards into Abjuration Essence."
	quest.7A4EE0566101DAA8.title: "Abjuration Essence"
	quest.7A703349590B66D5.quest_desc: [
		"Set up a sustainable Source generation system."
		""
		"Create at least one Source Link block and connect it to a Source Jar."
		"Keep an eye on how quickly jars fill and empty – bottlenecks here will slow your progression."
	]
	quest.7A703349590B66D5.title: "Generating Source Properly"
	quest.7AAD3CE642A34A0C.quest_desc: ["Acquire the Glyph: Blink to teleport short distances and reposition quickly in combat or exploration."]
	quest.7AAD3CE642A34A0C.quest_subtitle: "Short-range teleportation"
	quest.7AAD3CE642A34A0C.title: "Glyph: Blink"
	quest.7ACE7A6A71D3F4D2.quest_desc: ["Acquire or craft the Glyph: Intangible to allow spells to ignore physical barriers and pass through blocks or entities."]
	quest.7ACE7A6A71D3F4D2.quest_subtitle: "Walk through the world"
	quest.7ACE7A6A71D3F4D2.title: "Glyph: Intangible"
	quest.7B508BAFF547C820.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an Enchanting Apparatus and surround it with Arcane Pedestals."
		""
		"This structure lets you perform more advanced crafting recipes that combine items and Source."
		"Think of it as your magical crafting altar."
	]
	quest.7B508BAFF547C820.title: "The Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.7B50A64DCA297E36.quest_subtitle: "Forge a Lesser Air Focus to wield the magic of wind and sky."
	quest.7B50A64DCA297E36.title: "Lesser Air Focus"
	quest.7B99787599351103.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock a powerful late-game glyph."
		""
		"Integrate it into a new spell designed around that glyph’s strength:"
		"make something that really shows off your magical power."
	]
	quest.7B99787599351103.title: "High-Tier Glyphs"
	quest.7C289BF0837CFCB1.quest_desc: ["Forged in infernal fire, the Blazing Hellshelf is a perilous advancement of the lineage. It grants +10.00 Eterna (Max 65.00) and +10.00% Quanta, flooding the ritual with raw energy and chaos. Yet its brilliance comes at a cost: Enchanting Clues –1, stripping away guidance from the table. Without a Hellshelf of Sight to restore vision, the enchanter is left blind, doomed to gamble in the dark. The Blazing Hellshelf is not merely a tool—it is a trial, demanding mastery of hell itself to survive its power."]
	quest.7C289BF0837CFCB1.quest_subtitle: "Blazing of hell, doomed with chance."
	quest.7CDAC21CB3297976.quest_desc: ["Bathed in ritual and bound by enchantment, the Infused Hellshelf is a refined variant of its fiery predecessor. Created through infusion at the enchantment table, it requires a precise combination of Eterna, Quanta, and Arcana to awaken its latent power. Once infused, the shelf gleams with arcane brilliance, granting +5.00 Eterna (Max 60.00) and stirring +5.00% Quanta into the ritual. It is a shelf of advancement—where fire is tempered, chaos is invited, and energy ascends toward mastery."]
	quest.7CDAC21CB3297976.quest_subtitle: "Infusion of hell, surge of chance."
	quest.7DB656ABF9C0057A.quest_subtitle: "Ranks are tracked automatically based on time played, this can be viewed by looking at your in game statistics"
	quest.7E1DB88112C299ED.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Weaponry is bound exclusively to the enchantments of melee arms. It accepts only magics that empower swords, axes, and other close‑combat tools—whether granting sharpness, smiting, sweeping strikes, or durability. By channeling enchantments into this tome, adventurers ensure their weapon becomes a vessel of focused destruction, turning raw steel into a blade of purpose. It is a tome of battle, a record of enchantments meant to guide the warrior’s hand in the clash of arms."]
	quest.7E1DB88112C299ED.quest_subtitle: "A tome for the enchantments of the blade."
	quest.7E29CE5AA4257B2B.quest_desc: [
		"A spell is built from glyphs."
		""
		"Unlock the Touch glyph as your first form."
		"Touch decides that your spell is delivered point-blank, centered on what you click."
	]
	quest.7E29CE5AA4257B2B.title: "Learning Your First Glyph"
	quest.7EDC42C7B9827130.quest_desc: ["Spun from threads that shimmer with shifting light, the Prismatic Cobweb is no ordinary weave. When laid upon the anvil, it unravels the dark bindings of curses, stripping them cleanly from gear without harming the enchantments that remain. Its strands catch corruption and dissolve it, leaving only purified magic behind. To wield the Cobweb is to weave clarity from chaos—a rare gift that turns cursed relics into treasures once more."]
	quest.7EDC42C7B9827130.quest_subtitle: "The weave that unbinds curses."
	quest.7F3EB3F473DF8385.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Summon Undead to call forth undead minions to fight for you."]
	quest.7F3EB3F473DF8385.quest_subtitle: "Raise skeletal allies"
	quest.7F3EB3F473DF8385.title: "Glyph: Summon Undead"
	quest.7F69A7CD6ACA97D7.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Firework to create fireworks effects or combine them with other spells."]
	quest.7F69A7CD6ACA97D7.quest_subtitle: "Explosive celebration"
	quest.7F69A7CD6ACA97D7.title: "Glyph: Firework"
	quest.7F97805EE8DFC9F6.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Glyph: Grow to rapidly grow crops, saplings, and other plants with your magic."]
	quest.7F97805EE8DFC9F6.quest_subtitle: "Encourage nature"
	quest.7F97805EE8DFC9F6.title: "Glyph: Grow"
